<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">Vidunda Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mbuli Inojile yandichigwe na Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yoh</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mbuli Inojile yandichigwe na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yohana</para>
  <para style="imt">Chilongole</para>
  <para style="ip">Mbuli Inojile kota yandichigwe na Yohana ndo chimwe cha vitabu vine viwele kuli ilagano inyale, vilingusima mbuli ya ukomu wa Yesu Kilistu. Chila chimwe changuchemigwa Injili ilinguzeleka kota Mbuli Inojile. Navyandichigwa na Matei na Malichi na Lukasi na Yohana, hala Yesu loyabagame. Hanji yandichigwa na mtumigwa Yohana kuli mhela wa makumi tisa kulawila Yesu loyavumbuche. Hanga chitabu hachilingulonga kota Yohana ndo yandiche, vila yandichigwe naiwhana na zila baluwa za mwaluko na za keli na kadatu zandichigwe na Yohana. Wandiche katali ng'hatu walonga kota Yohana nakekala kuli muji wa Efeso, ahyo yangujesigwa kota na chitabu acho nachandichigwa ako Efeso.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yohana kangulonga kota chiwalo cha kwandika chitabu achi ndo kuwatanza wanhu wakunde kota Yesu ndo Kilistu, mwana wa Nguluwi yawele mkomu (Yohana 20:31). Kwa kukunda ako hetwe towa na ukomu kwa itagwa lyake. Chitabu nachandichigwa kwa weng'ha Wayahudi na hawawele Wayahudi. Mbuli Inojile yandichigwe na Yohana yavinji kuli zila Injili zinji zidatu. Nakandika menji ga vinduzanduza vyoyaditile Yesu na handiche menji ga nhelo zoyali yolangusa. Madito ganji kota kubatizigwa kwa Yesu na kujezigwa kugunuche, hakwandichigwe mlichitabu chino.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gali mgati</para>
  <para style="io">1. Yohana kangwandika Mbuli Inojile kuli sula ya (Yohana 1:18).</para>
  <para style="io">2. Hamba kangwandika vinduzanduza vinji vyoyaditile Yesu (Yohana 1:19-12:50).</para>
  <para style="io">3. Hamba kangusima madito menji kuli ukomu wa Yesu, gahilichile kuli kubagama kwa heye na kuzilipuka kwa heye (Yohana 13:1-20:31).</para>
  <para style="io">4. Yohana kangugongomanya Mbuli Inojile kuli sula ya 21 kwa kulonga Mbuli ya Yesu kulawila kwa wanhu hala loyazilipuche na hamba chiwalo cha heye kwandika chitabu.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s">Ulonzi nauwa munhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Aho mwaluko nakwali na ulonzi na awo ulonzi nawali hamwe na Nguluwi, nawo ulonzi nawali Nguluwi. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Kulawa mwaluko awo ulonzi nawali hamwe na Nguluwi. <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Kwa kukolela heye, vinhu vyeng'ha navilumbigwa, haduhu choneche chilumbigwe ne heye. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Heye nayali mwaluko wa ukomu na awo ukomu nawali lumuli lwa wanhu. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Lumuli alo lwangulangazaga kuli jiza, nalo jiza haluwezile kuusumya.<verse eid="JHN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Nguluwi nakamlajiza munhu yumwe itagwa lyake Yohani, <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />Yawele nakoya kuwalonjela wanhu kuwala mbuli za alo lumuli. Nakoya leka kwa usenga wa heye wanhu weng'ha wakunde. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Heye hawele alo lumuli, ila nakoya hela kuwalonjela wanhu kuwala alo lumuli. <verse eid="JHN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Alu ndo lumuli lwa kukomya ng'hatu, lumuli lulinguya kuli isi na kuwalangazila wanhu weng'ha.<verse eid="JHN 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Lelo, Ulonzi nawali kuli isi, kwa kukolela alo lumuli isi nailumbigwa, ila isi nahaluuzelele ulonzi. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Nawuya kuli isi ya heye, ila hewo wanhu hawaubochele ulonzi awo. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Ila wala wanhu waubochele na waukundile, nauwapa ludali lwa kuwa wana wa Nguluwi, <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />wawele hawapondigwe kwa danda ne kwa igano lya lukuli ama kwa igano lya munhu, ila kwa igano lya Nguluwi.<verse eid="JHN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Nawo ulonzi nauwa munhu, naukala kwa hetwe. Natwe natuwona welile wake, welile wake uwele ndo Mwana wa udewele wa Mhaza, naumema uganililo na kukomya.<verse eid="JHN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Yohani nakawalonjela wanhu mbuli zake, nakalonga kwa lizi, “Ayu ndo yula ndiwalonjele kota, ‘Kanguya munhu yumwe honhu ha heni yawele ndo mkulu kusinda heni, kwa vila heye nayali kung'hali heni kupondigwa.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Kwa kiwhana kwa kugoloka kwa heye, hetwe tweng'ha natubochela uganililo winji. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Kwa vila Nguluwi nakalavya malajizo kwa kukolela Musa, nawo uganililo wa kukomya nawutuyila kwa kukolela Yesu Kilistu. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Haduhu munhu yamuwene Nguluwi ne hado. Ila mwana wa udewele yewhanile na Nguluwi yawele yelumbile na Mhaza, ayo ndo yatuzelese mbuli za Nguluwi.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulolezi ya Yohani Mbatiza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matei 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Malichi 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Lukasi 3:1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Awu ndo ulolezi uwele Yohani nakaulavya mhela vilongozi wa Wayahudi lowawalajize watambika na Walawi kulawa Yelusalemu leka wamuuze, “Hegwe kwa whaani?” <verse eid="JHN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Yohani halemile kwidichila choyauzigwe, ila nakalonga ne kuvisa, “Heni siwele Kilistu.” <verse eid="JHN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Aho nawamuuza, “Lelo hegwe kwa whaani? Hegwe kwa Eliya?” Yohani nakedichila, “Hebu. Heni siwele Eliya.” Nawamuuza, “Hegwe ndo yula Mloli?” Yohani nakedichila, “Hebu!” <verse eid="JHN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Ahyo nawamuuza, “Lelo hegwe kwa whaani? Kwangulonga choni kuwala hegwe? Tulonjele leka tuwahilusile kwidichila kwa hegwe wala watulajize.” <verse eid="JHN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Yohani nakawedichila, “Heni ndo yula yawele mloli Isaya nakalonga mbuli zake kota,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:23">“ ‘Lizi lya munhu lyanguchema kugunuche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:23">mgolose nzila ya Mkulu.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Awo wanhu nawali walajizwe na Mafalisayo. <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />Lelo nawamuuza Yohani, “Wone hegwe hauwele Kilistu ne Eliya ne yula mloli, Iekachoni kwangubatiza?”<verse eid="JHN 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Yohani nakedichila, “Heni ndangubatiza kwa mazi, ila kabaho yumwe hali hemwe yohamzelele. <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />Ayo kanguya honhu ha heni, ila heni hambe nganigwe ne kudohola ng'weso za makwamba ga heye.” <figure style="fig" file="05 Sandals.jpg" size="col" ref="1:27">Munhu yalinguvala makwamba</figure><verse eid="JHN 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Mbuli azi nazikoleka ako Betaniya, kumwambu mwa lwanda lwa Yolodani kuwele Yohani nayali yowabatiza wanhu.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndo lyana Ing'holo lya Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Zuwa liwinzile, Yohani nakamona Yesu yokuya kwa heye, nakalonga, “Ayu ndo lyana ing'holo lya Nguluwi, lilingusa gehile ga isi yeng'ha! <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Ayu ndo yula munhu yondiwalonjele kota, ‘Munhu kanguya honhu ha heni yawele ndo mkulu kusinda heni, kwa vila nayali kung'hali heni sinapondigwa!’ <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Nani nasimzelele, ila nambuya kubatiza kwa mazi leka wanhu wa Isilaeli wamzele.”<verse eid="JHN 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Yohani kalavya ulolezi awu, “Nandimona Muhe Yelile yodulika kota ng'hunda kulawa kilanga na kugwa mchanya mwa heye. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Heni nasimzelele, ila yula yandajize kubatiza wanhu kwa mazi nayali yandonjele, ‘Wone komona munhu yawele Muhe Yelile yodulika kwa heye kulawa kilanga na kugwa mchanya mwa heye, ayo ndo yalingubatiza kwa Muhe Yelile.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Heni nambona mbuli ayi kota ayu ndo Mwana wa Nguluwi.”<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walanguswa wa mwaluko wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Hamitondo, Yohani nayali ako kahi na walanguswa wa heye weli. <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />Loyamuwene Yesu yokola, nakalonga, “Mlole! Ayu ndo lyana ing'holo lya Nguluwi!” <verse eid="JHN 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Wala walanguswa weli lowamhuliche Yohani, wamuwinza Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Lelo Yesu nakahinduka, nakawona awo walanguswa womuwinza heye, nakawauza, “Mwangupala choni?” Nawo nawedichila, “Labi, kwangikala kohi?” Labi mana yake mlangusa. <verse eid="JHN 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Yesu nakawalonjela, “Muye, namwe mohona.” Awo walanguswa nawamuwinza, nawahona honhu hoyawele ngikala, nawekala naye zuwa alyo. Nayali kota saa kumi matinazo.<verse eid="JHN 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Andeleya, mng'holoze Simoni Petili, nayali yumwe wa awo weli wamhuliche Yohani yolonga ago, naye ndo yamuwinzile Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Andeleya nakampala Simoni mng'holoze, nakamlonjela, “Natumona Masihi.” Mina ndo Kilistu. <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Hamba nakamigala Simoni kwa Yesu. Naye Yesu nakamlola Simoni nakalonga, “Hegwe ndo Simoni mwana Yohani. Ila kulawila sambi kochemigwa Kefa.” Chigilichi ndo Petili lilinguzeleka kota italawe.<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguwachema Filipo na Natanaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Zuwa liyage Yesu nakamula yalute Galilaya. Nakamfika Filipo nakamlonjela, “Umbinze.” <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Filipo nayali mwenyeng'haye wa Betisaida, muji mowalawile Andeleya na Petili. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Naye Filipo nakamfika Natanaeli, nakamlonjela, “Natumona munhu yawele Musa nakandika kuwala heye kuli chitabu cha Malajizo na waloli nawandika mbuli za heye, mina ndo Yesu mwana wa Yusufu, kulawa Nasaleti.” <verse eid="JHN 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Natanaeli nakamuuza Filipo, “Ndaze, chinhu chinojile choweza kulawa Nasaleti?” Filipo kamwidichila, “Uye ulole.” <verse eid="JHN 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Yesu lowamuwene Natanaeli yokuya kwa heye, nakalonga, “Mlole! Ayu ndo Muisilaeli wa kukomya, kahela uhadi mgati mwake.” <verse eid="JHN 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Natanaeli nakamuuza Yesu, “Nakunzela ndaze?” Yesu nakamlonjela, “Nandikona hala houwele hasi ha igodi lya mtini, kung'hali Filipo hanakuchema, nandikona.” <verse eid="JHN 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Aho Natanaeli nakalonga, “Mlangusa, hegwe ndo Mwana wa Nguluwi. Hegwe ndo Mndewa wa Isilaeli!” <verse eid="JHN 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Yesu nakamlonjela Natanaeli, “Ndaze, nakukunda kwa vila nandikulonjela kota nandikona hasi hali igodi lya mtini? Kogona makulu ng'hatu kusinda aga.” <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Yesu nakalutilila kuwalonjela, “Ndikomya ndanguwalonjela, mokona ulanga wangugubuka na wahilisi wa Nguluwi wokwina na kudulika mchanya mwa Mwana wa munhu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s">Mnvina ya kuhesa ako Kana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Zuwa lya kadatu nakwali na mnvina ya kuhesa kuli muji wa Kana, kuli mkowa wa Galilaya. Mayake Yesu nayali baho, <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />naye Yesu nayali yalalikwe kuli mnvina ayo hamwe na walanguswa wa heye. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Divai loimalile, mayake Yesu nakamlonjela mwanage, “Wahela divai.” <verse eid="JHN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Yesu nakamwidichila mayake, “Mamo uleche kundonjela cha kudita kwa vila mhela wa heni ung'hali.”<verse eid="JHN 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Aho mayake Yesu nakawalonjela walingukola mijito, “Choneche choyowalonjela, mkole.”<verse eid="JHN 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Aho nakwali na mibiga sita ja maganga, jiwele chila ibiga limwe nalyali lyanguweza kuwika madebe meli ama gadatu. Najali jiwichigwe aho kwa kiwhana na chihendo cha Wayahudi cha kihovuga. <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Yesu nakawalonjela wala wakola mijito, “Mjele mazi kuli mibiga ajo mbaka jimeme.” Nawo nawajimemeza mbaka najimema. <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Hamba nakawalonjela, “Lelo mdehe mumgalile chilongozi wa mvina.” <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />Mkulu wa mnvina loyajezile ago mazi, hambe nagali gagaluche na kuwa divai. Heye havizelele koilawile, ila wala wakola mijito wawele nawadeha gala mazi nawavizela. Chilongozi wa mvina nakamchema mkasano, <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />nakamlonjela, “Chila munhu kanguwikaga divai inojile ilongole, hamba ndo kangulavya yila yihile. Ila hegwe nakuwika divai inojile mbaka sambi!”<verse eid="JHN 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Yesu nakadita ulajilo awu wa mwaluko ako Kana kuli mkowa wa Galilaya. Nakalajila welile wa heye nawo walanguswa wa heye nawamkunda.<verse eid="JHN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Logakolile ago, Yesu nakadulika hamwe na mayake na wang'holoze na walanguswa wa heye mbaka Kapanaumu, kula nawekala kwa mazuwa mado.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguyeliza ng'handa wa Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Matei 21:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Malichi 11:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Lukasi 19:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Mnvina ya Pasaka ya Wayahudi loiwele habehi, ahyo Yesu nakaluta Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Lelo nakawafika wanhu kuli Ng'handa ya Nguluwi woguza misenga na ming'holo na ng'hunda na wanhu wanji nawali wovunza sendi wekale kuli visaga vya hewo. Munhu yawele yovunza sendi <figure style="fig" file="10 Money Changer.jpg" size="col" ref="2:14">Munhu yawele yovunza sendi</figure> <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Nakabota ng'hobwa ya ngozi, nakawawinga wanhu weng'ha kuli nonhu ha ng'handa ya Nguluwi hamwe na misenga na ming'holo jawo, nakavigwisa visaga vya wala walinguvunza sendi na kuboholanga sendi zawo. <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />Nakawalonjela walinguguza ng'hunda, “Muse vinhu avi hano. Mleche kuidita soko ng'handa ya Mhaza wa heni!” <verse eid="JHN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Walanguswa wa heye nawakumbuchila kota Maandiko Matakatifu gangulonga, “Maya ga heni kwa ng'handa ya hegwe wong'hopola.”<verse eid="JHN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Wayahudi wamwe nawamuuza Yesu, “Kodita chinduzanduza chachi leka kulajila kota kwanayo hachi ya kudita aga?” <verse eid="JHN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Yesu nakawedichila, “Muibene ayi ng'handa ya Nguluwi, nani ndoizenga kwa mazuwa gadatu.” <verse eid="JHN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Aho Wayahudi nawalonga, “Ayi Ng'handa ya Nguluwi naizenjigwa kwa mhela wa miyaka makumi gane na sita. Ndaze, hegwe koizenga kwa mazuwa gadatu hela?”<verse eid="JHN 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Ila Yesu nayali yolonga kuwala ng'anda ya Nguluwi iwele ndo lukuli lwake. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Lelo, loyazilpuche kulawa kwa wabagame, walanguswa wa heye nawakumbuchila kota nayali yalonjile ago, Nawagakunda Maandiko Matakatifu na wula ulonzi uwele Yesu nakalonga.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguzizela nhumbula za wanhu weng'ha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Yesu loyawele Yelusalemu kwa chiwalo cha mnvina ya Pasaka, wanhu wenji nawamkunda lowawene ulajilo loyauditile. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Ila Yesu hawele na makundo na hewo kwa vila nakawazela weng'ha. <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />Nahaganile kulonjelwa choneche kuwala munhu, kwa vila nakagazela geng'ha gawele mgati mwa nhumbula za hewo.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na Nikodemo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Nakwali na munhu yumwe yawele Myahudi, wa chilundo cha Mafalisayo, itagwa lyake lyali Nikodemo. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Zuwa limwe nakaluta kwa Yesu nechilo na kumlonjela, “Mlangusa, twanguvizela kota hegwe ndo mlangusa yalajizwe na Nguluwi, kwa vila kuduhu munhu yalinguweza kudita vinduzanduza vyoyalingudita Nguluwi wone hawele na heye.”<verse eid="JHN 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Yesu nakamlonjela, “Ndikomya ndangukulonjela, haduhu munhu yoweza kuwona Undewa wa Nguluwi wone hopondigwa lwa keli.” <verse eid="JHN 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Nikodemo nakamuuza, “Munhu mkulu koweza ndaze kupondigwa kahi? Hambe yaweze kwinjila mmunda mwa mayake na kupondigwa kahi!” <verse eid="JHN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Yesu nakamwdichila, “Ndikomya ndangukulonjela, wone munhu hapondigwe kwa mazi na muhe, howeza kwinjila kuli Undewa wa Nguluwi. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Munhu kangupondigwa lukuli kwa mhaza wa heye na mayake, ila kangupondigwa muhe kwa Muhe. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Uleche kijesa vyondikulonjele kota kwanguganigwa kupondigwa lwa keli. <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Mbeho yanguputaga kulutila koilingugana, kohulika lizi lyake, ila hauvizelele koulawile ne kouluta. Ahi ndo vyoili kwa munhu yapondigwe kwa Muhe.”<verse eid="JHN 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Nikodemo nakamuuza, “Mbuli azi zowa ndaze?” <verse eid="JHN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Yesu nakamwidichila, “Ndaze, hegwe kwa mlangusa kuli Isilaeli, ila hauzizelele mbuli azi? <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Ndikomya ndangukulonjela, twangulonga gala tugazelele na twangulonga ulolezi wa gala tugawene, ila hemwe wanhu hambe mkunde usenga wa hetwe. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Wone hamkundile hondiwalonjele mbuli za kuli isi, moweza kukunda hondiwalonjela mbuli za kilanga? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Haduhu munhu yalutile kilanga ila Mwana wa munhu, yawele nakadulika kulawa kilanga.”<verse eid="JHN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />Kota vila Musa vyoyalinule izoka lya shaba kula kugunuche, hiho du Mwana wa munhu kokwinuligwa kuchanya, <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />leka chila yalingukunda yawe na ukomu wa mazuwa gose. <verse eid="JHN 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />Kwa vila Nguluwi nakaigana isi mbaka nakamlavya Mwanage wa udewele, leka chila yomkunda yaleche kwajilila, ila yawe na ukomu wa mazuwa gose. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Kwa vila Nguluwi hamlajize Mwanage kuli isi leka yaitaguse isi, ila nakamigala leka yaigombole.<verse eid="JHN 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />“Yalingumkunda Mwana hambe yatagusigwe, yohambe yamkunde katagusigwa, kwa vila haumkundile Mwana wa udewele wa Nguluwi. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Utaguso awo ndo awu. Lumuli naluya kuli isi yeng'ha ila wanhu nawaligana jiza kusinda lumuli, kwa vila madito gawo ndo gehile. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Chila munhu yalingudita gehile kangululema lumuli, kwa vila hambe yagane madito ga heye gehile gawe hazelu. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Ila yalingudita ga kukomya kanguyaga kuli lumuli, leka madito ga heye goneche kota nagaditigwa kwa kumhulichiza Nguluwi.”<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Yohani Mbatiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Hamba, Yesu nakafika kuli mkowa wa Yudeya hamwe na walanguswa wa heye. Nakekala ako hamwe na hewo kwa mhela, yowabatiza wanhu. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Yohani naye nayali yobatiza wanhu ako Ainoni, habehi na Salemu, kwa vila ako nakwali na mazi menji. Wanhu nawaluta kwa heye, naye nakawabatiza. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />Mhela awo Yohani nayali hanawichigwa mchinweng'ho.<verse eid="JHN 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Kitwanza nakulawila hali walanguswa wa Yohani na Myahudi yumwe kuwala chihendo cha kihovuga kwa chiwalo cha kumfugamila Nguluwi. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Lelo, walanguswa awo nawaluta kwa Yohani na kumlonjela, “Mlangusa, yula munhu yawele hamwe na hegwe kumwambu mwa lwanda lwa Yolodani, yawele nakumlonjela mbuli za heye, sambi kangubatiza na wanhu weng'ha wanguluta kwa heye!” <verse eid="JHN 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Yohani nakamlonjela, “Munhu howeza kuwa na chinhu wone hapegwe na Nguluwi. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Namwe moweza kulavya ulolezi kota nandonga, ‘Heni siwele Kilistu, ila nandajizwa leka ndimlongole!’ <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Yalinguhesigwa ndo wa mkasano, ila goloko wa mkasano, yalingwima habehi na kuhulichiza, kangusangalalaga ng'hatu hala hoyomhulika mkasano yolonga. Kwa chiwalo achi, usangalalo wa heni nawenela. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Yangumgana heye yalutilile kuwa mkulu, nani ndiwe mdodo.”<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yalinguya kulawa kilanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />Yalinguya kulawa kilanga ndo ka mkulu kusinda weng'ha, yalingulawa kuli isi ndo wa isi na kangulongaga mbuli za isi. Ila yalinguya kulawa kilanga ndo mkulu kusinda weng'ha. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />Heye kalongaga gala goyagawene na kugahulika, ila haduhu munhu yalinguukunda usenga wa heye. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Ila munhu yoneche yalingukunda usenga wa heye kangutawizaga kota Nguluwi ndo wakukomya. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Yula yalajizwe na Nguluwi kangulongaga ulonzi wa Nguluwi, kwa vila Nguluwi kangummemezaga munhu ayo Muhe wa heye. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Mhaza kangumgana Mwana wa heye na nakampa vinhu vyeng'ha kuli moko ga heye. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Yalingumkunda Mwana kanawo ukomu wa mazuwa gose, yohambe yamkunde Mwana howa na ukomu wa mazuwa gose, ila kuzudila kwa Nguluwi kowa mchanya mwa heye.<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kangulongasa na mdala wa Samaliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Mafalisayo nawahulika kota Yesu nayali yobatiza na kupata walanguswa wenji kusinda Yohani. <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />Hanga hawele Yesu yuye yawele yobatiza, ila nawali walanguswa wa heye. <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />Lelo Yesu loyahuliche mbuli azo, nakoka Yudeya nakahiluka Galilaya, <verse eid="JHN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />kuli majendo ago naimlapa yakole Samaliya.<verse eid="JHN 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Lelo nakafika Sukali, muji uwele Samaliya, habehi na mgunda uwele Yakubu nakamha Yusufu mwanage. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Honhu aho nahali na ideho lya Yakubu, Yesu nayali yatochile kwa majendo, nakekalisa.<verse eid="JHN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Nakoya mdala yumwe wa Samaliya kudeha mazi. Yesu nakamlonjela, “Ndangulanda mazi nyinwe.” <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />Mhela awo walanguswa wa heye nawaluta kuli muji kugula chilyo.<verse eid="JHN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Yula mdala Msamalia nakamwidichila, “Hegwe kwa Myahudi, nani nda Msamaliya! Kwanguweza ndaze kundanda mazi ga kunwa?” Wayahudi nahawetanzaga na Wasamaliya kuli vinhu. <verse eid="JHN 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Yesu nakamwidichila, “Wone nauvizele ndolendole ya Nguluwi na whaani yalingukulonjela, ‘Umhe heni mazi nyinwe,’ wahamlandile, naye yahakupele mazi gawele na ukomu.” <verse eid="JHN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Mdala ayo nakamuuza, “Gwa! Mkulu, hegwe kwahela chinhu cha kudehela mazi na ideho ali ndo lya hasi ng'hatu, ago mazi ga ukomu kogapata kohi? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Ama hegwe kwa mkulu kusinda mhaza wa hetwe Yakubu yatupele ideho ali liwele heye hamwe na wana wa heye na migongolo ja heye nawalitumiya?” <verse eid="JHN 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Yesu nakamwidichila, “chila yalingunwa mazi aga kowa na ng'halu kahi. <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />Ila munhu yoneche yawele konwa mazi gawele ndomha, howa na ng'halu mazuwa gose. Mazi gondimha gowa mgati mwake na nzasa ya mazi ga ukomu na kumha heye ukomu wa mazuwa gose.” <verse eid="JHN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Ayo mdala nakamlonjela Yesu, “Mkulu, umhe heni ago mazi leka ndeche kuwa na ng'halu kahi na ndeche kuya hano kudeha mazi.” <verse eid="JHN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Yesu nakamlonjela yula mdala, “Ulute kamcheme mlume wa hegwe, uye naye hano.” <verse eid="JHN 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Yula mdala nakamwidichila, “Ndahela mlume.” Yesu nakamlonjela, “Nakukomya vyoulonjile kota kwahela mlume. <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />Kwa vila nawali na walume wahano, ayo youlingikala naye sambi hawele mlume wa hegwe. Aho nakulonga kwa kukomya.” <verse eid="JHN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Ayo mdala nakamlonjela, “Mkulu, ndangona kota hegwe kwa mloli. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Wasekulu wa hetwe nawafugama hali chidunda achi, ila hemwe mwangulonga kota honhu ha kumfugamila Nguluwi ndo kula Yelusalemu.” <verse eid="JHN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Yesu nakamlonjela yula mdala, “Mdala ung'hunde, mhela wanguya uwele hammfugamila Mhaza mchanya mwa chidunda achi ne kula Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Hemwe Wasamaliya mwangumfugamila yohambe mumzele, ila hetwe twangumzela ayo yotulingumfugamila, kwa vila ulohozi wangulawa kwa Wayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Ila mhela wanguya, kahi naufika, uwele walingufugama kwa kukomya womfugamila Mhaza kuli muhe na kukomya. Kwa vila Mhaza kanguwagana wanhu walingumfugamila ahyo. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Nguluwi ndo Muhe, ahyo wanhu walingumfugamila wanguganigwa kumfugamila kwa Muhe na kukomya.” <verse eid="JHN 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Yula mdala nakamlonjela Yesu, “Ndanguvizela kota Masiya yalinguchemigwa Kilistu, kanguya. Hoyokuya, kotuzelesa chila chinhu.” <verse eid="JHN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Yesu nakamlonjela, “Heni ndilingulonga ndo nene.”<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Mhela wuwo, walanguswa wa heye nawahiluka, nawabubuwala ng'hatu vyowamfichile Yesu yolongasa na mdala. Ila haduhu ne yumwe yamuuzile, “Kwangugana choni?” Ama “Lekachoni kwangulonga na ayu mdala?” <verse eid="JHN 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Yula mdala nakalileka ibiga lyake lya mazi, nakaluta kuli muji kuwalonjela wanhu, <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />“Muye mumlole munhu yandonjele mbuli zeng'ha zonditile! Ndaze, koweza kuwa heye ndo Kilistu?” <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Lelo wanhu nawoka kuli muji nawaluta koyawele Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Mhela wuwo walanguswa wa heye nawali womdedeza Yesu, “Mlangusa, ulye chilyo.” <verse eid="JHN 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Ila heye nakawedichila, “Ndina chilyo chiwele hamchizelele.” <verse eid="JHN 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Walanguswa wake nawaluka kiwuza, “Ndaze, hana munhu yamigalile chilyo?” <verse eid="JHN 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Yesu nakawalonjela, “Chilyo cha heni ndo kudita choyalingugana heye yandajize na kweneza mijito jake. <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Hemwe mwangulonga, ‘Jinghali myezi jine hela, mhela wa mbena wofika.’ Ila ndanguwalonjelani, mlole vila migunda vyojiwele goya kubetigwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Yalingubeta kangupegwa choyalinguganigwa kupegwa na yalingukungajiza mbena kwa chiwalo cha ukomu wa mazuwa gose, ahyo yalingunyala na yalingubeta wosangalala hamwe. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Ahyo ulonzi awu ndo wa kukomya, ‘Yumwe kangunyalaga na yunji kangubetaga.’ <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Heni nandiwalajiza mkabete mbena ziwele hamzilavile chituguti, ila hemwe mwangupata mzidi kwa chituguti cha hewo.”<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Wasamaliya wenji kuli muji wula nawamkunda Yesu kwa chiwalo cha ulonzi woyaulonjile yula mdala loyawalonjele kota, “Nakandonjela geng'ha gonditile.” <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Wasamaliya nawaluta kwa Yesu, nawamlanda yekale nawo. Yesu nakekala ako kwa mazuwa meli. <verse eid="JHN 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Wanhu wenji nawamkunda Yesu kwa chiwalo cha usenga wake. <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />Nawamlonjela yula mdala, “Hetwe hambe tukunde kwa chiwalo ulonzi wa hegwe, ila hetwe natwe natumhulika na twanguvizela kota ayu ndo Mlohozi wa isi yeng'ha.”<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangumlohola mwana wa chilongozi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Logakwete mazuwa meli Yesu nakoka, nakaluta Galilaya. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />Kwa vila Yesu nayali yalonjile, “Mloli hambe yahulichizwe kuli isi ya heye.” <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Lelo loyafichile Galilaya, wanhu wenji wa Galilaya nawambochela, kwa vila nawo nawali kuli mnvina ya Pasaka, nawazona mbuli zeng'ha zoyaditile ako Yelusalemu kuli mnvina ayo.<verse eid="JHN 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Yesu nakafika kahi ako kuli muji wa Kana kuli mkowa wa Galilaya, honhu hawele nakagalula mazi kuwa divai. Nakwali na chilongozi yumwe yawele na mwana yalingutamika ako Kapanaumu. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Lelo ayo chilongozi loyahuliche kota Yesu nayali yalawile Yudeya na kufika Galilaya, nakaluta kumlanda yalute kumlohola mwana wa heye yawele yotamika ng'hatu. <verse eid="JHN 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Yesu nakamlonjela, “Kuduhu munhu yokunda mbaka yavyone vinduzanduza na ulajilo.” <verse eid="JHN 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Yula chilongozi nakamlonjela, “Mkulu, dedede, tulute himahima kung'hali mwanangu hanabagama.” <verse eid="JHN 4:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Yesu nakamlonjela, “Ulute, mwanago kochikala.” Yula munhu nakakunda ulonzi wa Yesu, nakoka. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Loyawele mnzila, vitumagwa wake naweting'hana naye, nawamlonjela kota mwanage ka mkomu. <verse eid="JHN 4:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Naye nakawauza kota nawali mhela wachi uwele mwana nakaloholigwa, nawo nawamlonjela, “Zuwa likolile saa saba nemisi utamwa naumlechela.” <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Ayo chilongozi nakakumbuchila kota nawali ndo mhela wuwula uwele Yesu nakamlonjela, “Mwanago kochikala.” Baho nakakunda heye na ivyazi lyake lyeng'ha. <verse eid="JHN 4:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Awu nawali ulajilo wa keli woyaulajile Yesu loyawele yolawa Yudeya kuluta Galilaya.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kangumlohola munhu habehi na izimbo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Vyogapulute ago, nakwali na mnvina ya Wayahudi, naye Yesu nakaluta Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Ako Yelusalemu, habehi na lwizi lulinguchemigwa Lwizi lwa Ing'holo, nakwali na izimbo limwe lichemigwe kwa Chiebulaniya Betisata, liwele nalizungulutwa na lugagala banzi zihano. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Amo kuli lugagala namwali na watamwa wenji, wohambe walole na vyete na waziliche lukuli. Nawali wobeteza mazi gatiguligwe, <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />Kwa vila chila mhela mhilisi nayali yodulika kuli mazi na kugatigula. Munhu yoneche yawele kowa wa mwaluko kwinjila kuli mazi ago, nakaloholigwa utamwa woyawele nawo. <verse eid="JHN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Lelo aho nakwali na munhu yawele na utamwa kwa mhela wa miyaka makumi gadatu na jine. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Yesu loyamuwene ayo munhu yawasile nakuvizela kota nayali yekale aho kwa mhela winji, nakamuuza, “Ndaze, kwangugana uwe mkomu?” <verse eid="JHN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Yula mtamwa nakedichila, “Mkulu, heni ndahela munhu wa kunyhilika kuli mazi mhela hogotiguligwa. Chila hondijeza kwinjila munhu yunji kangulongola kwinjila.” <verse eid="JHN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Yesu nakamlonjela, “Winuche, uhole mcheka wako, ulute.” <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Baho du, ayo munhu nakawa mkomu, nakahola mcheka wake nakaluka kujenda. Mbuli ayi naikoleka kuli Zuwa lya Kwesela. <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />Ahyo wamwe wa Wayahudi nawamlonjela ayo munhu yaloholigwe, “Lehano ndo Zuwa lya Kwesela hailinguganigwa kupika mcheka wako.”<verse eid="JHN 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Ila heye nakawalonjela, “Yula munhu yawele nakandohola ndo yandonjele, ‘Uhole mcheka wako, ulute.’ ” <verse eid="JHN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Nawo nawamuuza, “Ayo munhu yawele nakakulonjela, ‘Uhole mcheka wako, ulute,’ ndo whaani?” <verse eid="JHN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Ila heye nahamzelele munhu yamlohole, kwa vila Yesu nayali yochile honhu hala kuli lung'hongola lwa wanhu. <verse eid="JHN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Hamba Yesu nakamfika yula munhu yaloholigwe kuli Ng'handa ya Nguluwi, nakamlonjela, “Lelo nakuloholigwa, uleche kudita gehile kahi leka uleche kufichigwa na mbuli yihile.” <verse eid="JHN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Yula munhu nakaluta kuwalonjela wala Wayahudi kota Yesu ndo yamlohole heye. <verse eid="JHN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Ahyo Wayahudi nawaluka kumtunya Yesu, kwa vila nayali yodita mbuli azo kuli Zuwa lya Kwesela. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Lelo, Yesu nakawalonjela, “Mhaza wa heni kangukola mijito mazuwa gose, nani ndangudita hiho.”<verse eid="JHN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Kwa chiwalo cha ulonzi awu, vilongozi wa Wayahudi nawalutilila kupala nzila ya kumkopola Yesu, haiwele kota nakabena mzilo wa Zuwa lya Kwesela hela ila kwa vila nakalonga kota Nguluwi ndo Mhaza wa heye, ahyo nakewhaniza na Nguluwi.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ludali lwa Mwana wa Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Yesu nakawalonjela, “Ndikomya ndanguwalonjela, Mwana howeza kudita chinhu yaliyeka, kanguweza kudita chila choyodita Mhaza, kwa vila choyodita Mhaza, Mwana kodita hihila. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Mhaza kangumganaga Mwana na kumlajila chila chinhu choyodita heye, kahi komlajila mbuli ng'hulu kusinda azi, namwe mobubuwala. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Kota vila Mhaza vyoyowazilipulaga wabagame na kuwapa ukomu, hihyo du naye Mwana kawapaga ukomu wala yalinguwagana. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Mhaza hambe yamtaguse munhu yoneche, mbuli yeng'ha ya utaguso nakamlechela Mwana, <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />leka wanhu weng'ha wamhulichize Mwana kota vila vyowalingumhulichiza Mhaza. Yohambe yamhulichize Mwana halingumhulichiza Mhaza yawele yamlajize.<verse eid="JHN 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />“Ndikomya ndanguwalonjela, yalinguhulichiza ulonzi wa heni na kumkunda yula yandajize, kana ukomu wa mazuwa gose. Hotagusigwa, ila kowa yalochile kulawa kuli kubagama na kwinjila kuli ukomu. <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />Ndikomya ndanguwalonjela, mhela wanguya, naufika, uwele wabagame wolihulika lizi lya Mwana wa Nguluwi, nawo wawele woihulika wowa na ukomu. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Kota vila Mhaza vyoyawele mwaluko wa ukomu, hihyo du ndo nakamha Mwanage yawe mwaluko wa ukomu. <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />Kahi nakamha ludali lwa kutagusa kwa chiwalo heye ndo Mwana wa munhu. <verse eid="JHN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />Mleche kububuwala kwa mbuli ayi mwa vila mhela wanguya uwele weng'ha kuli vilaga wohulika lizi alyo, <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />nawo wozilipuka, wala waditile ganojile, wozilipuka na kikala na wala waditile gehile wozilipuka na kutagusigwa.<verse eid="JHN 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walolezi wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />“Heni siweza kudita kwa ludali lwa heni yeka. Ndangutagusa kota vyondilinguhulika kulawa kwa Mhaza, nawo utaguso wa heni ndo wa hachi. Kunuwila kwa heni hakuwele kwa kugana heni, ila vyoyogana heye yandajize. <verse eid="JHN 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />Wone nandonje kuwala heni, ulolezi wa heni haukundigwa kota wa kukomya. <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Ila kabaho yunji yawele kolavya ulolezi kuwala heni, nani ndanguvizela kota geng'ha goyalingulonga kuwala heni ndo kakomya. <verse eid="JHN 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />Hemwe namlajiza usenga kwa Yohani naye nakalonga kwa kukomya. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Haiwele heni ndangitumbila ulolezi wa wanhu, ila ndangulonga mbuli azi leka mloholigwe. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Yohani nayali kota chenje chilingwaka na kulangaza, namwe namwali goya kusangalala kwa chiwalo cha lumuli alo kwa mhela uchefu.<verse eid="JHN 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />“Ila ndina ulolezi kuwala heni uwele ndo ukulu ng'hatu kusinda ula wa Yohani. Kwa vila mijito jondilingukola, mijito joyamhele Mhaza ndijikole, ndo jilingulonga kota Mhaza ndo yandajize. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Naye Mhaza yandajize nakalonga kuwala heni. Hemwe hamnawahika kuhulika lizi lya heye, ne kukona kumeho kwa heye <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />na usenga wa heye hambe ukale mgati mwa hemwe kwa vila hammkundile yula yamlajize. <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />Hemwe mwangugalolaga goya Maandiko Matakatifu kuno mchijesa kota mgati mwake mopata ukomu wa mazuwa gose, maandiko gago gangulonga kuwala heni. <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />Ila hemwe mwangulema kuya kwa heni leka muwe na ukomu.<verse eid="JHN 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />“Silingupala kutogoligwa na wanhu. <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />Ila ndanguwazela hemwe, ndanguvizela kota mwahela igano lya Nguluwi kuli nhumbula za hemwe. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Nambuya kwa ludali lwa Mhaza wa heni, ila hambe mmbochele heni, ila munhu yunji hoyokuya kwa ludali lwake yuye mombochela. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Mwanguweza ndaze kukunda hanga hemwe mwangugana kubochela lutogo kulawa kwa hemwe, ne hambe mpale lutogo kulawa kwa heye yuye yawele yaliyeka kwa Nguluwi? <verse eid="JHN 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />Mleche kijesa kota heni ndoyowalonjeleza kwa Mhaza. Musa yawele hemwe namumtumbila ndo yowalonjeleza. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Wone nahamkundile Musa, mwahang'hundile heni kahi, kwa vila Musa nakandika kuwala heni. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Ila hambe mgakunde gala goyandiche, lelo moweza ndaze kukunda ulonzi wa heni?”<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguwapa chilyo wanhu elufu zihano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matei 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Malichi 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Lukasi 9:10-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Hamba Yesu nakaloka ilamba lya Galilaya, liwele kahi lyanguchemigwa ilamba lya Tibeliya. <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Lung'hongola lukulu lwa wanhu nalumuwinza Yesu kwa vila wanhu awo nawali nawona ulajilo loyaditile kwa kuwosela matamwa walingutamika. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Yesu nakakwina kuli chidunda, nakekala hamwe na walanguswa wa heye. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Mnvina ya Wayahudi ilinguchemigwa Pasaka nayali habehi. <verse eid="JHN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Lelo Yesu loyonile lung'hongola lwa wanhu lwanguya kwa heye, nakamlonjela Filipo, “Togula kohi mibumunda leka wanhu awa walye?” <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Yesu nakalonga ahyo kwa kumjeza Filipo, kwa vila nakavizela kota choni choyodita. <verse eid="JHN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Filipo nakamwidichila, “Hanga natuwe na sendi denali miya mbili hazitosa kugula mibumunda ja kulya wanhu awa weng'ha.” <verse eid="JHN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Yumwe wa walanguswa wa heye yalinguchemigwa Andeleya, yawele mng'holoze Simoni Petili, nakalonga, <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />“Hana msongolo yawele na mibumunda jihano ja shayili na somba mbili, ila avi vyoweza kuhega kwa wanhu wenji kota wano?” <verse eid="JHN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Yesu nakalonga, “Muwalonjele wanhu wekalise.” Nakwali na misolo minji honhu aho. Lelo, wanhu nawekalisa, weng'ha nawali wanhu walume elufu zihano. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Yesu nakajihola jila mibumunda, nakajitambichiza, nakawagawila wala wanhu wekalise, nakadita hihila na zila somba, chila munhu nakapata vila vyoyaganile. <verse eid="JHN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Wanhu lowegute Yesu nakawalonjela walanguswa wa heye, “Mlokoteze vihande visigale vileche kwajilila.” <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Lelo, nawalokoteza vihande vya mibumunda ja shayili vyowavilechile wala wanhu wawele nawalya, nawavimemeza vidoto kumi na vili. <verse eid="JHN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Wanhu lowauwene ulajilo awo loyaulajile Yesu, nawalonga. “Ndikomya, ayu ndo mloli yalinguya kuli isi.” <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Yesu nakavizela kota wanhu nawagana wamhole na kumdita yawe mndewa, nakoka kahi, nakaluta kuli chidunda yaliyeng'ha.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangujenda mchanya mwa mazi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Matei 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Malichi 6:45-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Loifichile matinazo, walanguswa wa Yesu nawadulika mbaka kuli ilamba, <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />nawakwina itumbwi leka waloche kuluta Kapanaumu. Jiza nayali yinjile, mhela awo Yesu nayali yang'hali hanafika kwa hewo. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Ilamba nalyaluka kutiguka kwa vila mbeho nayali iputa. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Walanguswa lowalutile utali wa kilometa zihano ama sita hino, nawamona Yesu yojenda mchanya mwa mazi, yolihejelela itumbwi, nawadumba ng'hatu. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Yesu nakawalonjela, “Ndo heni! Mleche kudumba!” <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Lelo nawagana kumuhola Yesu kuli itumbwi, baho du itumbwi nalifika kumwambu hafungo kowawele woluta.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu wangumpala Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Loifichile hamitondo lung'hongola lwa wanhu wala wasigale ubanzi uyage wa ilamba nawavizela nakwali na itumbwi limwe hela hala na Yesu henjile kuli itumbwi hamwe na walanguswa wa heye, ila walanguswa awo nawali walutile waliyeng'ha. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Mitumbwi jinji kulawa Tibeliya najuya honhu hala wanhu howadile mibumunda, Mkulu loyasindile kumtogola Nguluwi. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Lelo, awo wanhu awo lowavizele kota Yesu na walanguswa wa heye nawali haduhu honhu hala, nawakwina itumbwi, nawaluta Kapanaumu kumpala Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndo libumunda lya ukomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Wala wanhu lowamfichile Yesu kumwambu mwa ilamba, nawamuuza, “Mlangusa, nakuya nili hano?” <verse eid="JHN 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Yesu nakawedichila, “Ndikomya ndanguwalonjela, hemwe hambe mmhale heni kwa vila namona ulajilo na vinduzanduza, ila kwa vila namulya jila mibumunda na kiguta. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Mleche kitunya kwa chilyo chilingola, mitunye kwa chilyo chilingikala mhela winji kwa chiwalo cha ukomu wa mazuwa gose chiwele Mwana wa munhu kowapa. Heye ndo yawele Mkulu Nguluwi nakamuwika muhuli.” <verse eid="JHN 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Hewo nawamuuza Yesu, “Tudite choni leka tuweze kukola mijito ja Nguluwi?” <verse eid="JHN 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Yesu nakawedichila, “Aji ndo mijito yalingugana Nguluwi mjidite, mumkunde yula yamlajize.”<verse eid="JHN 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Aho nawamlonjela, “Kolajila chinduzanduza chachi tuchone leka tukukunde? Kodita chinhu chachi? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />Wasekulu wa hetwe nawalya mana kula kugunuche, kota Maandiko Matakatifu vyogalingulonga, ‘Nakawapa ibumunda kulawa kilanga.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Yesu nakawalonjela, “Ndikomya ndanguwalonjela, Musa hawapele mibumunda kulawa kilanga, Mhaza wa heni ndo yalinguwapa hemwe mibumunda lya kukomya kulawa kilanga. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Kwa vila ibumunda lya Nguluwi ndo yula yalingudulika kulawa kilanga na yalinguipa isi ukomu.” <verse eid="JHN 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Lelo, nawamlonjela, “Mkulu, kulawila sambi utupe alyo ibumunda mazuwa gose.” <verse eid="JHN 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Yesu nakawalonjela, “Heni ndo ibumunda lilingigala ukomu. Yalinguya kwa heni hokona nzala, yalingung'hunda hokona ng'halu mazuwa gose. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Ila nandiwalonjela, nammbona ila hamlingung'hunda. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Weng'ha yalingumha heni Mhaza wokuya kwa heni, nani simtoza kunze munhu yoneche yolinguya kwa heni, <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />kwa vila nandulika kulawa kilanga haiwele kwa kudita kota vyondilingugana, ila kweneza kugana kwa yula yandajize. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Aga ndo yalingugana yula yandajize, kota, ndeche kumwajiliza ne yumwe wa wala yamhele, ila ndiwazilipule hewo kuli zuwa lya kuduma. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Kwa vila choyalingugana Mhaza wa heni ndo achi, chila yolingumona Mwana na kumkunda yawe na ukomu wa mazuwa gose, nani ndomzilipula kuli zuwa lya kuduma.”<verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Lelo Wayahudi nawaluka kung'ung'uta kwa vila Yesu nakalonga, “Heni ndo ibumunda liduliche kulawa kilanga.” <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Nawalonga, “Ndaze, ayu hawele mwana wa Yusufu? Twangumzela mhaza wa heye na mamo wa heye! Lelo, kanguweza ndaze kulonga kota nakadulika kulawa kilanga?” <verse eid="JHN 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Yesu nakawalonjela, “Mleche kung'ung'uta kwa chiwalo cha heni. <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Haduhu munhu yoweza kuya kwa heni, wone Mhaza yandajize hamkwejile kwa heni, nani ndomzilipula munhu ayo kuli zuwa lya kuduma. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />Waloli nawandika, ‘Wanhu weng'ha wolanguswa na Nguluwi.’ Chila munhu yalinguhulichiza Mhaza na kilangusa kwa heye ayo kanguyaga heni. <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Haduhu munhu yoneche yamonile Mhaza ila yula yalingulawa kwa Nguluwi, heye ndo yaliyeng'ha yamuwene Mhaza. <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />Ndikomya, ndanguwalonjela, yalingukunda kana ukomu wa mazuwa gose. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Heni nda ibumunda lilingigala ukomu. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Wasekulu wa hemwe nawalya mana kula kugunuche, ila nawabagama. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Ila ali ndo ibumunda lilingundulika kulawa kilanga leka yoneche yalingulya yaleche kubagama. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Heni nda ibumunda lya ukomu lila lilawile kilanga. Munhu yoneche hoyolya libumunda ali, kochikala mazuwa gose. Ibumunda ali ndo lukuli lwa heni, luwele ndolulavya kwa chiwalo cha ukomu wa isi yeng'ha.”<verse eid="JHN 6:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Aho ndo Wayahudi nawaluka kitwanza wolonga, “Munhu ayu kanguweza ndaze kutupa lukuli lwake tulye?” <verse eid="JHN 6:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Yesu nakawalonjela, “Ndikomya ndanguwalonjela, wone hamulya lukuli lwa Mwana wa munhu na kunwa danda ya heye, hamuwa na ukomu mgati mwa hemwe. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Yalingulya lukuli lwa heni na kunwa danda ya heni kanawo ukomu wa mazuwa gose, nani ndomzilipula kuli zuwa lya kuduma. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />Kwa vila lukuli lwa heni ndo chilyo cha kukomya na danda ya heni ndo chakunwa cha kukomya. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Yoneche yolya lukuli lwa heni na kunwa danda ya heni, kochikala mgati mwa heni, nani ndochikala mgati mwa heye. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Mhaza yawele mkomu nakandajiza, nani ndangikala kwa chiwalo cha heye, ahyo yula yawele yolya lukuli lwa heni, kochikala kwa chiwalo cha heni. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Lelo, ali ndo ibumunda liduliche kulawa kilanga, haliwele kota mana wawele nawalya wasekulu wa hemwe, nawabagama. Ila yawele yolya ibumunda ali kowa mkomu mazuwa gose.” <verse eid="JHN 6:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Yesu nakalonga ago loyawele yolangusa kuli sunagogi ako Kapanaumu.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulonzi ulingigala ukomu wa mazuwa gose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Lelo, walanguswa wenji lowahuliche ago, nawalonga, “Azi ndo mbuli ng'hulu! Whaani yalinguweza kuzihulichiza?” <verse eid="JHN 6:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Yesu nakavizela ne kulonjelwa na munhu kota walanguswa wa heye nawali wong'ung'uta kwa chiwalo cha mbuli ayo, nakawauza, “Ndaze, mbuli ayi naiwazudiza? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Yowa ndaze, hommona Mwana wa munhu yokwina kuluta kuchanya koyalawile? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Muhe ndo ulingigala ukomu, lukuli hambe lutanze chinhu. Ulonzi wondiwalonjele ndo muhe na ukomu. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Ila wamwe wa hemwe hambe wakunde.” Yesu nakalonga ahyo kwa vila kulawa mwaluko nakawazela wawele hambe wakunde na whaani yawele yomhinduka. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Hamba nakalonga, “Achi ndo chiwalo chiwele nandiwalonjela kota haduhu munhu yoweza kuya kwa heni mbaka yawe nakatambichizwa na Mhaza wa heni.”<verse eid="JHN 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Kulawa mhela awo walanguswa wa heye wenji nawahiluka kumbele, nawaleka kumuwinza. <verse eid="JHN 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Lelo Yesu nakawauza wala walanguswa kumi na weli, “Ndaze, namwe mwangugana kuka?” <verse eid="JHN 6:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Simoni Petili nakamwidichila, “Mkulu, toluta kwa whaani? Hegwe kwanawo ulonzi wa ukomu wa mazuwa gose. <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />Hetwe twangukunda na kuvizela kota hegwe ndo yula Yelile wa Nguluwi.” <verse eid="JHN 6:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Yesu nakawalonjela, “Ndaze, siwahagule hemwe kumi na weli? Ila yumwe wa hemwe ndo Limazoga!” <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Yesu nakalonga ago kwa chiwalo cha Yudasi, mwana wa Simoni Isikalioti, kwa vila ayo nayali ndo yomhinduka, hanga nayali yumwe wa wala kumi na weli.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na wang'holoze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Logamalile ago, Yesu nayali yojenda ako Galilaya. Nahaganile kujenda kuli mkowa wa Yudeya kwa vila wandewa wa Wayahudi nawali wogana kumkopola. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Mnvina ya Wayahudi ya vibumuli nayali habehi. <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />Lelo, wang'holoze Yesu nawamlonjela, “Wuche hano, ulute Yudeya leka walanguswa wa hegwe wajone mijito ja hegwe joulingukola. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Munhu hambe yadite mbuli kwa uviso wone kangugana kuzeleka kwa wanhu. Kwa vila kwangudita mbuli azi, lelo wizelese kuli isi.” <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Mbaka wang'holoze Yesu nahawamkundile. <verse eid="JHN 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Lelo, Yesu nakawalojela, “Mhela wa heni haunafika, ila kwa hemwe chila mhela wa goya. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Isi haiweza kuwazudila hemwe, ila heni yanguzudila kwa vila ndangulavya ulolezi kwa chiwalo cha heye kota madito gake ndo geha. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Hemwe mlute kuli mnvina ayo. Heni siluta kuli mnvina ayo, kwa vila mhela wa heni haunafika.” <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Nakalonga ago, nakapona Galilaya.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kuli mnvina ya vibumuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Wang'holoze lowalutile kuli mnvina, Yesu naye nakaluta ila kwa uviso. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Vilongozi wa Wayahudi nawali wompala Yesu kuli mnvina ayo, nawauza, “Kakohi?”<verse eid="JHN 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Nakwali na kupwepwa kwinji hali lung'hongola. Wamwe wa hewo nawalonga, “Ndo munhu yanojile.” Wanji nawalonga, “Hebu! Kanguwajiliza wanhu.” <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Haduhu munhu ne yumwe yajezile kulonga mbuli za heye hazelu kwa kuwadumba vilongozi wa Wayahudi.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Mnvina ayo loifichile hagati, Yesu naye nakaluta kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi, nakaluka kulangusa. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Lelo, Wayahudi nawabubuwala na kulonga, “Munhu ayu nakapata kohi uwanzi na hasomile?” <verse eid="JHN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Aho Yesu nakawedichila, “Malanguso gondilingulangusa hagawele ga heni, ila ndo ga heye yandajize. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Munhu yalingugana kudita gala goyalingugana Nguluwi, kovizela kota malanguso ga heni nagalawa kwa Nguluwi, ama ndangilonjela hela. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Heye yalingilonjela hela kangupala lutogo lwa heye yuye, ila yalingupala kumtogola yula yamlajize, ayo ndo wa kitumbila na mgati mwake mwahela wihe woneche. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Ndaze, Musa hawapele malajizo? Ila haduhu ne yumwe wa hemwe yalinguwinza ago malajizo. Lekachoni mwangugana kung'hopola?” <verse eid="JHN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Aho wanhu nawamwidichila, “Kuna chijeni hegwe! Whaani yalingugana kukukopola?”<verse eid="JHN 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Yesu nakawedichila, “Hana mbuli imwe yonditile, namwe mwangububuwala kwa mbuli ayo. <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Musa nakawapa chila chihendo cha kwinjiza ikumbi. Chihendo acho hachiwele nachilawa kwa Musa, ila nachilawa kwa wasekulu. Lelo hemwe hamlingumwinjiza munhu ikumbi kuli Zuwa lya Kwesela. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Wone munhu kangwinjizwa ikumbi kuli Zuwa lya Kwesela leka ilajizo lileche kubenigwa, lekachoni mwangunzudila kwa vila nandimdita munhu yawe mkomu kuli Zuwa lya Kwesela? <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Mleche kutagusa mbuli yoneche kwa kulola hela, mlavye utaguso kwa hachi.”<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndaze, ayu ndo Kilistu?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Wanhu wamwe wa Yelusalemu nawalonga, “Ndaze, yula munhu walingumpala wamkopole hawele ayu? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Mlole! Kanguwakanya hazelu ne haduhu munhu yalingumlonjela chinhu. Ama vilongozi nawavizela kota ayu ndo Kilistu? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Kilistu hoyokuya haduhu munhu yovizela honhu hoyalawile, ila hetwe twanguvizela koyalawile munhu ayu!”<verse eid="JHN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Lelo, Yesu loyawele yolangusa kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi nakakwiniza lizi na kulonga, “Hemwe mwangunzela na kuhazela kondawile. Suyile kwa chiwalo cha heni, ila heye yandajize ndo wa kukomya namwe hamzelele. <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />Ila heni ndangumzela kwa vila nandawa kwa heye, naye ndo yandajize.”<verse eid="JHN 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Lelo, wanhu nawagana kumibata, ila haduhu munhu yawezile kumibata kwa vila mhela wa heye nawali haunafika. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Nawo wanhu wenji nawamkunda, nawalonga, “Ndaze, Kilistu hoyokuya kodita ulajilo ukulu ng'hatu kusinda munhu ayu?”<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wamizi wangulajizwa kumibata Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Mafalisayo nawawahulika wanhu wopwepwa ulonzi awo kuwala Yesu. Lelo, hewo hamwe na watambika wakulu nawawalajiza wamizi wamibate. <verse eid="JHN 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Yesu nakalonga, “Heni nda hamwe na hemwe kwa mhela uchefu, hamba ndoluta kwa heye yandajize. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Momhala ila hammbona na honhu hondiwa hemwe hamuweza kufika.”<verse eid="JHN 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Vilongozi wa Wayahudi nawalongasa, “Munhu ayu koluta kohi kuwele hetwe hatuweza kumfika? Koluta kwa Wayahudi wasambaluche hali Wagilichi na kuwalangusa Wagilichi? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Kana mana yachi hoyolonga, ‘Momhala ila hambona na hala hondiwa hemwe hamuweza kufika?’ ”<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nzanda za mazi ga ukomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Zuwa lya kuduma lya mnvina, zuwa lila likulu. Yesu nakema, nakalonga kwa lizi likulu, “Munhu yoneche yawele na ng'halu, yoye kwa heni yanwe. <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />Kota Maandiko Matakatifu vyogalingulonga, ‘Yalingung'hunda, nzanda za mazi ga ukomu zochililika kulawa kuli nhumbula ya heye.’ ” <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Nakalonga ago kuwala Muhe yawele wala wamkundile wombochela. Mhela awo Muhe Yelile nayali hanafika kwa vila Yesu nayali hanapegwa ukulu na Nguluwi.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kilewa hali wanhu kuwala Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Wanhu wamwe kuli lula lung'hongola nawahulika ulonzi awo, nawalonga, “Ndikomya, munhu ayu ndo yula mloli!” <verse eid="JHN 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Wanji nawalonga, “Ayu ndo Kilistu!” Ila wanji nawalonga, “Ndaze, Kilistu koweza kulawa Galilaya? <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Ndaze, Maandiko Matakatifu hambe galonje kota Kilistu kokuya kulawa kuli lukolo lwa Daudi na kulawa Betelehemu kuli muji woyekale Daudi?” <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Ayo wanhu nawebagula kwa chiwalo cha Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Wanhu wamwe nawagana kumibata ila kuduhu yawezile kumdoliza.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vilongozi wa Wayahudi wahela makundo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Hamba wala wamizi nawahiluka kwa watambika wakulu na Mafalisayo, nawo nawawauza, “Lekachoni hammigale?” <verse eid="JHN 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Wamizi nawedichila, “Haduhu munhu yawezile kulonga kota heye!” <verse eid="JHN 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Mafalisayo nawawauza, “Ndaze, namwe namuhadigwa? <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />Ndaze, hana chilongozi yoneche ama yumwe wa Mafalisayo yamkundile? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Ila lung'hongola alu halugazelele malajizo ga Musa, nalupanjilwa.” <verse eid="JHN 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Aho Nikodemo, yula yawele nakaluta kwa Yesu zuwa limwe nechilo, yawele nayali yumwe wa hewo nakauza, <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />“Ndaze, malajizo ga hetwe gangukundiza kumtagusa munhu ne kumhulichiza na kuvizela goyaditile?” <verse eid="JHN 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Nawo nawamwidichila, “Ndaze, nagwe nakulawa Galilaya? Lelo, kagalole goya Maandiko Matakatifu nagwe kogona kota Galilaya hakulawaga Mloli.” <verse eid="JHN 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />Hamba weng'ha nawoka, chila munhu nakaluta haluga hake.<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s">Muhinza mnghondwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Yesu nakaluta kuli chidunda cha Mizeituni. <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Mitondo lufuku, Yesu nakaluta kahi kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi. Wanhu weng'ha nawamlutila, naye nakekalisa na kwaluka kuwalangusa. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Walangusa wa malajizo ga Musa na Mafalisayo nawamigala mdala yawele nawamibata yodita ung'hondwa. Namuwika hagati ha wanhu weng'ha. <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />Hamba nawamlonjela Yesu, “Mlangusa! Mdala ayu nakafichigwa yodita ung'hondwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Kuli malajizo, Musa nakalajiza mdala kota ayu kanguganigwa yatowigwe na maganga mbaka yabagame. Lelo, hegwe kwangulonga ndaze?” <verse eid="JHN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Nawalonga ayo kumjeza Yesu, leka wapate mbuli ya kumlonjeleza. Ila Yesu nakenamiza, nakandika hasi kwa chidole. <verse eid="JHN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Lowalutile kumuuza Yesu nakenuka, nakawalonjela, “Yalihela gehile hali hemwe yawe wa mwaluko kumtowa na iganga.” <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Hamba nakenamiza kahi, nakwandika hasi. <verse eid="JHN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Lowahuliche ago, nawaluka kuka yumweyumwe, nawaluka wasekulu. Yesu nakapona yaliyeka na ayula mdala yemile bahala. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Yesu loyenuche nakamuuza yula mdala, “Wakohi wala wanhu? Ndaze, haduhu ne yumwe yakutaguse?” <verse eid="JHN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Ayo mdala nakedichila, “Mkulu haduhu ne yumwe!” Yesu nakamlonjela, “Nani sikutagusa. Ulute, kulawila sambi uleche kudita kahi gehile.”<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndo lumuli lwa isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Hamba Yesu nakalonga nawo kahi, “Heni nda lumuli lwa isi. Munhu yoneche yombinza hojenda kuli jiza mazuwa gose, ila kowa na lumuli lwa ukomu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Lelo, Mafalisayo nawamlonjela, “ulolezi wa hegwe hambe ukundigwe kwa vila kwangulavya ulolezi ulingukuwala gwegwe.” <verse eid="JHN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Yesu nakawedichila, “Hanga ndangulavya ulolezi ulinguwala heni, ulolezi wa heni ndo wa kukomya kwa vila ndanguvizela kondilawile na kondilinguluta. Ila hemwe hamvizelele kondawile na kondiluta. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Hemwe mwangutagusa kwa kuwinza mbuli za lukuli, ila heni hambe ndimtaguse munhu. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Hanga ndokutagusa, utaguso wa heni ndo wa kukomya kwa vila heni siwele ndiliyeka, Mhaza yandajize ka hamwe na heni. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />Nayandichigwa kuli malajizo ga hemwe kota ulolezi wa wanhu weli ndo wa kukomya. <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />Ndangulavya ulolezi kuwala heni, naye Mhaza yandajize, kangulavya ulolezi kuwala heni.” <verse eid="JHN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Aho nawamuuza, “Mhaza wa hegwe kakohi?” Yesu nakawedichila, “Hemwe hamnzelele heni ne Mhaza. Wone namnzelele heni, mwahamzelele na Mhaza wa heni.”<verse eid="JHN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Yesu nakalonga ulonzi awo loyawele yolangusa kuli chihengo cha ng'hano kuli Ng'handa ya Nguluwi. Ila haduhu munhu yamibate kwa vila mhela wake nawali haunafika.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kondiluta hemwe hamuweza kufika.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Yesu nakawalonjela kahi, “Ndanguluta namwe momhala, ila mobagama kuli gehile ga hemwe. Kondiluta, hemwe hamuweza kufika.” <verse eid="JHN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Lelo, vilongozi wa Wayahudi nawalonga, “Ndaze, kochikopola! Lekachoni kangulonga, ‘Kondiluta hemwe hamuweza kufika?’ ” <verse eid="JHN 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Yesu nakawalonjela, “Hemwe namlawa baha hasi, heni nandawa kuchanya, hemwe ndo wa isi, heni siwele wa isi. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Ahyo nandiwalonjela kota mobagama kuli gehile ga hemwe. Wone hamkunda kota ‘Heni ndo Yula,’ mobagama kuli gehile ga hemwe.” <verse eid="JHN 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Nawo nawamuuza, “Hegwe kwa whaani?” Yesu nakawedichila, “Nandiwalonjela kulawa mwaluko! <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Ndina mbuli nyinji za kulonga kuwala hemwe. Ila heye yandajize ndo wa kukomya, nani ndanguilonjela isi mbuli zila zonyhuliche kulawa kwa heye.”<verse eid="JHN 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Hawavizelele kota Yesu nayali yolonga na hewo kuwala Mhaza. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Lelo, Yesu nakawalonjela, “Hommwinula Mwana wa munhu, aho ndo movizela kota, ‘Heni ndo yula ndonjile kota hambe ndite mbuli yoneche ndiliyeka ila ndangulonga gala gawele Mhaza wa heni nakandangusa. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Yula yandajize ka hamwe na heni, heye handechile ndiliyeka kwa vila mazuwa gose ndangudita gala galingumnojeza.’ ” <verse eid="JHN 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Loyalonjile ago wanhu wenji nawamkunda.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukomya kowapa kilejeha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Yesu nakawalonjela wala Wayahudi wamkundile, “Wone mogakunda malajizo ga heni mowa walanguswa wa heni wa kukomya. <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />Ahyo movizela kukomya, nako kukomya kowapa hemwe kilejeha.” <verse eid="JHN 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Nawo nawamwidichila, “Hetwe ndo walelwa wa Abulahamu na hatuwele vitumagwa wa munhu yoneche. Lekachoni kwangulonga, ‘Mowa milejehe?’ ” <verse eid="JHN 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Yesu nakawedichila, “Ndikomya ndanguwalonjela, chila munhu yalingudita gehile ka chitumagwa wa gehile. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Chitumagwa hambe yawazigwe kuli ivyazi mazuwa gose, ila mwana kanguwazigwa kota yumwe wa lukolo mazuwa gose. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Wone Mwana kowapa kilejeha mowa na kilejeha ng'hatu. <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Ndanguvizela kota hemwe mwa ivyazi lya Abulahamu. Ila mwangugana kung'hopola kwa vila hambe mgakunde malanguso ga heni. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Ndangulonga gala goyandajile Mhaza, ila hemwe mwangudita gala goyawalonjele mhaza wa hemwe.”<verse eid="JHN 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Hewo nawamwidichila, “Hetwe twa wana wa Abulahamu.” Yesu nakawalonjela, “Wone hemwe namuwe wana wa Abulahamu, mwahaditile kota vyoyaditile Abulahamu. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Nandiwalonjela kukomya kondikuhuliche kwa Nguluwi, lelo, hemwe mwangugana kung'hopola. Abulahamu haditile ahyo! <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Hemwe mwangudita mbuli zizila zoyaditile mhaza wa hemwe.” Hewo nawamlonjela, “Hetwe hatuwele nahatupondigwe kwa ung'hondwa! Twanaye mhaza yumwe hela, yawele ndo Nguluwi.” <verse eid="JHN 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Yesu nakawalonjela, “Wone Nguluwi nayawele Mhaza wa hemwe, mwahanganile, kwa vila nandawa kwa Nguluwi na sambi nda hano. Suyile kwa ludali lwa heni ila heye yandajize. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Lekachoni hambe mvizele gondilonga? Kwa vila hambe mhulichize usenga wa heni. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Hemwe mwa wana wa mhaza wa hemwe, Limazoga, namwe mwangugana kweneza choyogana mhaza wa hemwe. Heye nayali yalingukopola kulawa mwaluko, hehanzile na kukomya kwa vila kuduhu kukomya mgati mwa heye. Hoyolonga udesi kangulongaga gawele ga heye yuye kwa vila heye ka mdesi na ndo mhaza wa udesi. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Heni ndangulonga kukomya, acho ndo chiwalo hemwe hambe mng'hunde. <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Whaani hali hemwe yoweza kutawiza kota ndina gehile? Wone ndangulonga kukomya, lekachoni hambe mng'hunde? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Yawele wa Nguluwi kanguhulichizaga ulonzi wa Nguluwi. Ila hemwe hambe mhulichize kwa vila hamuwele wanhu wa Nguluwi.”<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulonga kwa Yesu kuwala heye na Abulahamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Wayahudi nawamlonjela Yesu, “Ndaze, hatulonjile kukomya kota hegwe kwa Msamalia na kuna limazoga?” <verse eid="JHN 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Yesu nakawedichila, “Ndahela limazoga, ndangumhulichiza Mhaza wa heni, ila hemwe mwangumbeza heni. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Heni hambe mhale welile wa heni, ka baho yumwe yalingupala welile awo, naye ndo mtagusa. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Ndikomya ndanguwalonjela, yalinguhulichiza ulonzi wa heni hobagama mazuwa gose.” <verse eid="JHN 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Lelo, Wayahudi nawalonga, “Lelo natuvizela kota kuna limazoga! Abulahamu nakabagama na waloli nawo nawabagama, hegwe kwangulonga, ‘Yalinguhulichiza ulonzi wa heni hobagama mazuwa gose!’ <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Ndaze, hegwe kwa mng'hangala kusinda Mhaza wa hetwe Abulahamu yawele nakabagama? Mbaka waloli nawo nawabagama. Hegwe kwangidita kwa whaani?” <verse eid="JHN 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Yesu nakawedichila, “Wone ndochitogola nene, welile wa heni wowa wa hihi hela. Mhaza wa heni yawele hemwe mwangulonga ndo Mhaza wa hemwe, ndo yalingunhogola. <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />Hemwe hamzelele, ila heni ndangumzela. Wone ndonje hambe ndimzele, ndowa mdesi kota hemwe. Heni ndangumzela na ndanguhulichiza ulonzi wa heye. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Mhaza wa hemwe Abulahamu nakatowa luchenze kuno yochitumbila kulyona zuwa lya kuya kwa heni na mhela loyaliwene nakasangalala.” <verse eid="JHN 8:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Lelo, Wayahudi nawamlonjela, “Hegwe naung'hali fika miyaka makumi gahano, kwangulonga nakumona Abulahamu?” <verse eid="JHN 8:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Yesu nakawalonjela, “Ndikomya ndanguwalonjela, kung'hali Abulahamu kupondigwa, heni nandali baho” <verse eid="JHN 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Aho nawalokota maganga leka wamtowe, ila Yesu nakevisa, nakalawa kuli Ng'handa ya Nguluwi.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kangumdita yalole munhu yohambe yalole kulawila kupondigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Yesu loyawele yokola nakamona munhu yumwe, yohambe yalole kulawila kupondigwa. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Lelo, walanguswa nawamuuza, “Mlangusa! Whaani yaditile gehile, munhu ayu ama mhaza wa heye ama mayake mbaka yapondigwe yohambe yalole?” <verse eid="JHN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Yesu nakedichila, “Mbuli ayi hailawile kwachiwalo cha gehile ga heye ama gehile ga mhaza wa heye ama gehile ga mayake, ila nakapondigwa yohambe yalole leka welile wa Nguluwi woneche kuli kikala kwa heye. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Yangutugana tulutilile kukola mijito ja yula yatulajize kung'hali nemisi, kwa vila nechilo yanguya iwele munhu hambe yaweze kukola mijito. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Mhela londing'hali kuli isi, heni nda lumuli lwa isi.” <verse eid="JHN 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Loyalonjile ago, Yesu nakatema mite hasi nakadita nhope, kambakaliza yula yohambe yalole kumeho, <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />nakamlonjela, “Ulute kehovuje kumeho kuli izimbo lya Siloamu.” Siloamu mana yake ndo yalajizwe. Aho yula munhu nakaluta, nakehovuga kumeho, hamba nakahiluka yolola.<verse eid="JHN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Lelo walingikalasa habehi na heye, wala wawele nawavizela kota aho hamwande nayali mzunwa yalingulanda, nawalonga, “Ayu hawele yula mzunwa yawele yokalisa na kulanda?” <verse eid="JHN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Wamwe wa hewo nawalonga, “Ndo heye,” Wanji nawalonga, “Hebu! Ila kangiwhana na heye.” Ila ayo yawele yohambe yalole nakawalonjela, “Ndo nene!” <verse eid="JHN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Lelo nawamuuza, “Naiwa ndaze meho gako nagagubuligwa?” <verse eid="JHN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Naye nakawedichila, “Yula munhu yalinguchemigwa Yesu nakadita nhope, nakambakaliza heni kumeho na kundonjela, ‘Lute kehovuje kuli izimbo lya Siloamu.’ Aho heni nanduta, nandihovuga nakwaluka kulola.” <verse eid="JHN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Nawamuuza, “Heye ka kohi?” Naye nakawedichila, “Heni sivizelele!”<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mafalisayo wangulola goya kuwala kuloholigwa kwa yohambe yalole</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Hamba wanhu nawamhilika yula munhu yawele yohambe yalole kwa Mafalisayo. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Nalyo nalyali zuwa lya kwesela liwele Yesu loyaditiche nhope na kugagubula meho ga ayo munhu. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Lelo, Mafalisayo nawamuuza munhu ayo, “Nakuweza ndaze kona?” Naye nakawalonjela, “Nakambakaliza heni nhope kumeho, nani nandihovuga kumeho, lelo ndangulola.” <verse eid="JHN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Wamwe wa Mafalisayo nawalonga, “Munhu ayu halawile kwa Nguluwi, kwa vila hambe yebate malajizo ga Zuwa lya Kwesela.” Ila wanji nawalonga, “Munhu yawele na gehile koweza ndaze kudita ulajilo kota awa?” Nakwali na kilewa hali hewo. <verse eid="JHN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Nawamuuza kahi yula munhu yawele yohambe yalole, “Kwa vila heye nakagubula meho ga hegwe, kwangulonga ndaze kuwala heye?” Naye nakawalonjela, “Heye ka mloli!”<verse eid="JHN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Vilongozi wa Wayahudi hawakundile kota aho mwaluko munhu ayo nayali yohambe yalole na sambi kangulola, mbaka vyowawachemile mhaza wa heye na mayake. <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />Lelo, nawamuuza mhaza wa heye mayake, “Ndaze, ayu ndo mwana wa hemwe muwele hemwe mwangulonga nakapondigwa yohambe yalole? Lelo naiwa ndaze kangulola?” <verse eid="JHN 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Mhaza wa heye na mayake nawedichila, “Twanguvizela kota ayu ndo mwana wa hetwe na nakapondigwa yohambe yalole. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />Ila nakaweza ndaze kulola, hatuvizelele, kahi hatumzelele yamgubule meho. Mumuuze heye yuye, heye sambi kakula, kanguweza kilewela.” <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Mhaza wa heye na mayake nawalonga ahyo kwa kuwadumba vilongozi wa Wayahudi kwa vila vilongozi awo nawali wehanyise kota munhu yoneche hoyokunda kota Yesu ndo Kilistu kowinjigwa kuli sunagogi. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Ahyo mhaza wa heye na mayake nawalonga, “Heye kakula sambi, mumuuze.”<verse eid="JHN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Lelo, nawamchema kahi yula munhu yawele nayali yohambe yalole, nawamlonjela, “Ulonje kukomya hali Nguluwi wa hegwe! Hetwe twanguvizela kota munhu ayu ndo yawele na gehile.” <verse eid="JHN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Heye nakawedichila, “Wone yawele na gehile heni sivizelele. Ila mbuli yondiizelele kota nandali yohambe yalole na sambi ndangulola.” <verse eid="JHN 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Lelo, nawamuuza, “Nakakuditila choni? Nakagagubula ndaze meho ga hegwe?” <verse eid="JHN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Ayo munhu nakawedichila, “Nandiwalonjela, namwe hamunyhulichize, lekachoni mwangugana kuhulika kahi? Ndaze, hemwe namwe mwangugana muwe walanguswa wa heye?” <verse eid="JHN 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Ila hewo nawamliga wolonga, “Hegwe kwa mlanguswa wa heye, hetwe twa walanguswa wa Musa. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Hetwe twanguvizela kota Nguluwi nakalonga na Musa, ila munhu ayu hatuvizelele nakalawa kohi!” <verse eid="JHN 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Naye nakawedichila, “Ayi ndo mbuli ya kububuwaza! Hemwe hamvizelele nakalawa kohi, ila nakagubula meho ga heni! <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Twanguvizela kota Nguluwi hambe yawahulichize wanhu wawele na gehile, ila kamhulichizaga yoneche yalingumdumba na kweneza igano lya heye. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Kulawila mwaluko wa isi hatuhuliche kota munhu nakagagubula meho ga munhu yawele nakapondigwa yohambe yalole. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Wone ayu munhu halawile kwa Nguluwi, hayaliweza kudita choneche!” <verse eid="JHN 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Hewo nawamwidichila, “Hegwe nakupondigwa na kulolelwa kuli gehile, kwanguweza ndaze kutulangusa hetwe?” Lelo, nawamuwinga kuli sunagogi.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yohambe yalole yaloholigwe kangumkunda Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Yesu nakahulika kota yula yawele yohambe yalole nakawinjigwa kuli sunagogi. Lelo, loyamfichile nakamuuza, “Ndaze, kwangumkunda Mwana wa munhu?” <verse eid="JHN 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Yula munhu nakedichila, “Mkulu, ndonjele heye ka whaani, leka ndimkunde.” <verse eid="JHN 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Yesu nakamlonjela, “Nakumona, naye ndo yalingulongasa na hegwe sambi.” <verse eid="JHN 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Lelo, yula munhu nakalonga, “Mkulu, ndangukunda!” Nakafugama.<verse eid="JHN 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Yesu nakalonga, “Heni nambuya kuli isi kutagusa, leka wohambe walole, walole, nawo walingulola wawe wohambe walole.” <verse eid="JHN 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Mafalisayo wamwe wawele hamwe na heye nawahulika ulonzi awo, nawamuuza, “Ndaze, hetwe natwe hambe tulole?” <verse eid="JHN 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Yesu nakedichila, “Wone mwahawele mohambe mlole, hamwali kuwa na nongwa ya gehile, ila lelo mwangulonga, ‘Twangulola,’ ahyo yangulajila kota mna nongwa.”<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s">Mdimi yanojile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />Yesu nakawalonjela, “Ndikomya ndanguwalonjela, yoneche yohambe yenjile kuli ibani lya ming'holo kwa kukolela kuli lwizi, ila kangwinjila kwa kukolela nzila yinji, ayo ndo mhiza na yalinguboka. <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Ila yalingwinjila kwa kolela hali lwizi, ayo ndo mdimi wa ming'holo. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Mlolela ibani kangumchumulilaga na ming'holo janguhulikaga lizi lya heye, naye kangujichemaga ming'holo jake chila limwe kwa itagwa lyake na kujilavya mgati mwa ibani. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Hoyojilavya, kangujilongolaga, najo ming'holo jangumuwinzaga, kwa vila jangulizela lizi lyake. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Ming'holo ajo hambe jimuwinze munhu mjenzi, ila jombilima, kwa vila hambe jilizele lizi lya heye.” <verse eid="JHN 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Yesu nakawalonjela nhelo ayo, ila hewo nahawavizelele choni choyaganile kuwalonjela.<verse eid="JHN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndo mdimi yanojile.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Yesu nakalonga kahi, “Ndikomya ndanguwalonjela, heni ndo lwizi lwa ming'holo. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Wala wanji weng'ha walongole kuya kung'hali heni ndo wahizi na walinguboka, najo ming'holo hajiwahulichize. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Heni ndo lwizi. Yalingwinjila kwa kukola kwa heni koloholigwa, kokwinjila na kulawa na kopata honhu ha kudima. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Muhizi kanguyaga kwa kunuwila kuhiza, kukopola na kuwifya. Heni nambuya leka wanhu wawe na ukomu, ukomu wenele.<verse eid="JHN 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />“Heni nda mdimi yanojile. Mdimi yanojile kanguulavyaga ukomu wa heye kwa chiwalo cha ming'holo jake. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Munhu wa kupegwa mijito kwa chiwalo cha sendi yawele hawele mdimi ne ming'holo hajiwele ja heye, hoyolyona libwa lya kisolo likuya, kangujilekaga ming'holo na kubilima, hamba libwa lya kisolo lyangujibataga na kujisambalula. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />Heye hambe yejese kuwala ming'holo kwa vila heye ndo munhu wa kupegwa sendi hela. <verse eid="JHN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />Heni nda mdimi yanojile. Ndanguwazela wawele wa heni, nawo wawele wa heni wangunzela, <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />kota hila Mhaza vyoyalingunzela, nani vyondilingumzela Mhaza. Heni ndanguulavya ukomu wa heni kwa chiwalo cha ming'holo. <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />Kahi ndanajo ming'holo jinji jiwele jahaduhu kuli ibani. Ndanguganigwa kujigala kuli ibani, najo johulika lizi lya heni na kowa na chilundo chimwe na mdimi yumwe.<verse eid="JHN 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />“Mhaza kangungana kwa vila ndanguulavya ukomu wa heni leka mhate kuubochela kahi. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Haduhu munhu yalingusukula ukomu wa heni, ndanguulavya kwa kugana nene. Ndanalo ludali wakuulavya na ludali lwa kuuhola kahi. Ahi ndo Mhaza vyoyandajize ndite.”<verse eid="JHN 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Nakwali na kilewa kahi hali Wayahudi kwa chiwalo cha ulonzi awo. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Wenji wa hewo nawalonga, “Kana chijeni, kahi kana lukwale! Lekachoni tumuhulichize?” <verse eid="JHN 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Wanji nawalonga, “Awu hauwele ulonzi wa yawele na chijeni. Ndaze, chijeni changuweza kugagubula meho ga wohambe walole?”<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangulemigwa na Wayahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Ako Yelusalemu nakwali na mnvina ya kuiwika chiuyeng'ha Ng'handa ya Nguluwi ako Yelusalemu, nawo nawali mhela wa chipute. <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />Naye Yesu nayali yojenda mgati mwa Ng'handa ya Nguluwi kuli chituka cha Solomoni. <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Lelo, Wayahudi nawamzunguluta, nawamuuza, “Kotuleka na lunhwinhwi mbaka nili? Wone hegwe ndo Kilistu, lelo utulonjele hazelu.” <verse eid="JHN 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Yesu nakawedichila, “Nandiwalonjelani, ila hambe mng'hunde. Mijito jondilingukola kwa itagwa lya Mhaza wa heni jangulonga kuwala heni. <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />Ila hemwe hambe mkunde kwa vila hamuwele ming'holo ja heni. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Ming'holo ja heni janguhulikaga lizi lya heni, heni ndangujizela najo jangumbinza. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />Heni ndangujipa ukomu wa mazuwa gose, najo hajikwajilila mazuwa gose, haduhu munhu yojilavya kuli moko wa heni. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />Mhaza wa heni yawele ndo yamhele heni ajo ming'holo ndo mkulu kusinda weng'ha, haduhu yoweza kujilavya kuli moko ga Mhaza. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Heni na Mhaza ndo chinhu chimwe.”<verse eid="JHN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Lelo, Wayahudi nawalokota maganga, leka wamtowe. <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Yesu nakawalonjela, “Nandiwalajila mijito minji kulawa kwa Mhaza. Jakohi hali ajo jilinguwadita mnhowe na maganga?” <verse eid="JHN 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Wayahudi nawamwidichila, “Hambe tukutowe na maganga kwa chiwalo cha mijito jinojile, ila kwa chiwalo cha kumliga Nguluwi! Kwa vila kwangidita kota Nguluwi hanga kwa munhu hela.” <verse eid="JHN 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Yesu nakedichila, “Ndaze, hayandichigwe kuli chitabu cha Malajizo ga Musa kota, ‘Heni nandonga, hemwe ndo milungu?’ <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Nguluwi nakawachema milungu wala wawele nawapegwa usenga wa heye, natwe twanguvizela kota Maandiko Matakatifu gangulonga kukomya mazuwa gose. <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />Ndaze, heye yawele Mhaza nakamuwika chiuyeng'ha na kumlajiza kuli isi, mwangumlonjela, ‘Kwanguliga,’ kwa vila nandonga, ‘Heni ndo Mwana wa Nguluwi?’ <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Wone silingukola mijito ja Mhaza wa heni, mleche kung'hunda. <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />Ila wone ndangujikola mijito ja Nguluwi, hanga hambe mng'hunde, lelo mjikunde ajo mijito, leka mpate kuvizela kota Mhaza ka mgati mwa heni, nani mgati mwa heye.” <verse eid="JHN 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Nawajeza kahi kumibata ila nakasulupuka kuli moko ga hewo.<verse eid="JHN 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Yesu nakaluta kahi kumwambu mwa lwanda lwa Yolodani, honhu hawele Yohani nayali yobatiza, nakekala ako. <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Wanhu wenji nawaluta kwa heye nawalonga, “Yohani nahaditile ulajilo woneche. Ila gala geng'ha goyalonjile kuwala munhu ayu ndo gakukomya ng'hatu.” <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Wanhu wenji wa honhu aho nawamkunda.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s">Kubagama kwa Lasalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Munhu yumwe yalinguchemigwa Lasalo, mwenyeng'haye wa Betaniya, nayali mtamwa. Chijiji cha Betaniya nachali honhu walingikala Maliya na Malita lumbulye. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Maliya ndo yula yambakalize Yesu mafuta ga kunhunyhilila na kumbagusa kwa mnvili za heye. Lelo Lasalo yawele yotamika ndo lumbulye. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Lelo awo wadala nawahilika usenga kwa Yesu, “Mkulu, goloko wa hegwe ka mtamwa!” <verse eid="JHN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Yesu loyahuliche ago, nakalonga, “Utamwa awo haumkopola, ila ndo kwa chiwalo welile wa Nguluwi, nakatamika leka kwa nzila ayo Mwana wa Nguluwi yatogoligwe.”<verse eid="JHN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Yesu nakamgana Malita lumbulye Lasalo. <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Loyahuliche kota Lasalo ka mtamwa, Yesu nakalutilila kikala honhu aho loyawele kwa mazuwa meli. <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Hamba nakawalonjela walanguswa wa heye, “Tulute kahi Yudeya.” <verse eid="JHN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Walanguswa nawamlonjela, “Mlangusa! Mhela uchefu hela ukolile Wayahudi nawali wogana kukukopola kwa maganga, kwangugana ulute ako kahi?” <verse eid="JHN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Yesu nakawedichila, “Ndaze, hakuwele na masaa kumi na meli kuli nemisi imwe? Lelo, munhu hoyojenda nemisi howeza kikwang'hwala kwa vila kanguwona lumuli lwa isi ayi. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Ila munhu hoyojenda nechilo, kochikwang'hwala kwa vila lumuli lwa haduhu mgati mwa isi.” <verse eid="JHN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Yesu loyasindile kulonga ulonzi awu nakamlonjela, “Goloko wa hetwe Lasalo nakawasa, ila heni ndoluta kumdita yalilimche.” <verse eid="JHN 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Walanguswa wa heye nawamlonjela, “Mkulu, wone yawasile, kolilimka.” <verse eid="JHN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Hewo nawejesa kota nayali yalonjile kuwala usinjizi hela, hambi nayali yolonga kuwala kubagama kwa Lasalo. <verse eid="JHN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Lelo, Yesu nakawalonjela hazelu, “Lasalo nakabagama, <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />ila ndangusangalala kwa vila siwele ako leka mkunde. Lelo tulute kwa heye.” <verse eid="JHN 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Tomasi yalinguchemigwa mnyambili nakawalonjela walanguswa wayage, “Tulute, natwe tubagame hamwe na heye.”<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndo uzilipulo na ukomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Yesu loyafichile ako nakamfika Lasalo yatiligwe mchilaga mazuwa gane gakolile. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Chijiji cha Betaniya nachali habehi na Yelusalemu, kwa utali wa kilometa zidatu. <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />Wayahudi wenji nawoya kuwahembuliza Malita na Maliya kwa kubagama kwa lumbulyawo Lasalo.<verse eid="JHN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Malita loyahuliche kota Yesu nayali yokuya, nakaluta kumlamsa, ila Maliya nakasigala kaye. <verse eid="JHN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Malita nakamlonjela Yesu, “Mkulu, wone nauwe hano, lumbulyangu nahali bagama! <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Ila ndanguvizela kota choneche choumlanda Nguluwi, kokupa.” <verse eid="JHN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Yesu nakamlonjela, “Lumbulyo kozilipuka.” <verse eid="JHN 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Malita nakamwidichila, “Ndanguvizela kota kozilipuka mhela wa uzilipulo, zuwa lya kuduma.” <verse eid="JHN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Yesu nakamlonjela, “Heni ndo uzilipulo na ukomu. Yalingung'hunda kowa mkomu hanga kobagama, kochikala, <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />chila yalingikala na kung'hunda, hobagama. Ndaze, kwangukunda aga?” <verse eid="JHN 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Malita nakamlonjela, “Ena Mkulu! Ndangukunda kota hegwe kwa Kilistu, Mwana wa Nguluwi, yula yalinguya kuli isi.”<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangulila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Loyalonjile ago, Malita nakaluta kumchema Maliya, mkulugwe, nakamlonjela kwa uviso, “Mlangusa ka hano, kangukuchema.” <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Naye loyahuliche, nakoka himahima nakaluta kwa Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Yesu nayali yang'hali kwinjila kuli chijiji, ila nayali bahala Malita hoyamlamse. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Lelo, Wayahudi wawele hamwe na Maliya haluga womhembuliza lowamuwene yochile himahima na kulawa mgati, nawamuwinza kuno wochijesa kota nayali yoluta kula kuli chilaga kulombocheza.<verse eid="JHN 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Lelo, Maliya loyafichile honhu hoyawele Yesu na kumona, nakafugama, nakamlonjela, “Mkulu, wone nauwe hano kalumbu nahali bagama!” <verse eid="JHN 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Yesu loyamuwene Maliya yolila na wala Wayahudi woyile hamwe na heye wangulila, nakawa na masinzo na kudeula mnhumbula. <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />Hamba nakawauza, “Nammuwika kohi?” Nawamwidichila, “Mkulu, uye uhalole.” <verse eid="JHN 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Yesu nakalila. <verse eid="JHN 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Lelo, Wayahudi nawalonga, “Mlole vila vyoyamganile!” <verse eid="JHN 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Ila wamwe wa hewo nawalonga, “Ndaze, ayu yamgubule meho yula yohambe yalole, hawezile kumdita Lasalo yaleche kubagama?”<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangumzilipula Lasalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Lelo, Yesu loyawele masinzo mnhumbula, nakaluta kuli chilaga. Chilaga acho nachali mhalika chiwele chigubikwe na iganga. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Yesu nakalonga, “Muse alyo iganga!” Malita, lumbulye ayo yabagame nakamlonjela, “Mkulu, nakaluka kunhung'ha kwa vila kamchilaga kwa mazuwa gane!” <verse eid="JHN 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Yesu nakamlonjela Malita, “Sikulonjele kota wone ukunde kowona ukulu wa Nguluwi?” <verse eid="JHN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Lelo, nawosa lila iganga, Yesu nakalola kilanga, nakalonga, “Ndangukutogola Mhaza kwa vila hegwe kwangunyhulichiza. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Ndanguvizela kota kwangunyhulika mazuwa gose. Ila nandonga ago kwa chiwalo cha wanhu awa leka wakunde kota hegwe ndo undajize.” <verse eid="JHN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Vyoyalonjile ago, nakachemeleza kwa lizi likulu, “Lasalo! Ulawe mgati!” <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Ayu yawele nakabagama nakalawa mgati, kuno yawopigwe sanda kuli magulu na moko na kumeho kwa heye nakugubikwa. Yesu nakawalonjela, “Mumdohole na mumleche yalute.”<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kiwika goya kwa chiwalo cha kumkopola Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matei 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Malichi 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Lukasi 22:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Lelo, Wayahudi wenji wafichile kwa Maliya lowaiwene mbuli ayo loyaiditile Yesu, nawamkunda. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Ila wamwe wa hewo nawaluta kwa Mafalisayo nawalonga kuwala mbuli ayo yaiditile Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Lelo watambika wakulu na Mafalisayo nawadita nhing'hano ng'hulu, nawalonga, “Tudite ndaze? Munhu ayu kangudita ulajilo winji lukami.<figure style="fig" file="18 Priest.jpg" size="col" ref="11:47">Mtambika wa Chiyahudi</figure> <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Wone tumleche, wanhu weng'ha womkunda, nawo wanhu wa Loma wokuya kuiwifya ng'handa ya Nguluwi wa hetwe na isi ya hetwe!” <verse eid="JHN 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Aho yumwe wa hewo yalinguchemigwa Kayafa, yawele nayali mtambika mkulu kuli mwaka awo, nakawalonjela, “Hemwe hamvizelele chinhu! <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Ndaze, hamvizelele kota fola munhu yumwe yabagame kwa chiwalo cha wanhu, kusinda isi yeng'ha idumigwe?” <verse eid="JHN 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Halonjile ago kwa ludali lwa heye yuye, ila kwa vila nayali mtambika mkulu kuli mwaka awo, nakalavya uloli kota Yesu kobagama kwa chiwalo cha isi ya hewo, <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />haiwele kwa chiwalo cha isi ya hewo hela ila kwa chiwalo cha wana wa Nguluwi wasambaluche.<verse eid="JHN 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Lelo, kulawila zuwa alyo vilongozi wa Wayahudi nawewika goya kumkopola Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Ahyo Yesu hajendile kahi hazelu hali Wayahudi, ila nakalawa aho, nakaluta honhu hawele habehi na kugunuche, kuli muji ulinguchemigwa Efulaimu. Nakekala ako hamwe na walanguswa wa heye. <verse eid="JHN 11:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Mnvina ya Wayahudi ya Pasaka nayali habehi, wanhu wenji nawaluta Yelusalemu leka wewelize kung'hali mnvina ayo. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Lelo, nawali wompala Yesu. Nawo lowekungajize kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi naweuza, “Mwangona ndaze! Yangoneka kota hambe yoye kuli mnvina ayi?” <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Mtambika mkulu na Mafalisayo nawali walavile mzilo kota wone munhu yavizele honhu hoyawele Yesu yawalonjele leka wamibate.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kangubakalizwa mafuta ga kununyhilila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Matei 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Malichi 14:3-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Mazuwa sita kung'hali mnvina ya Pasaka hainafika, Yesu nakafika Betaniya koyekale Lasalo yawele Yesu nakamzilipula kulawa kuli wabagame. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Ako nawamwichila goya Yesu chilyo cha nechilo, naye Malita nayali yowakolela mijito. Lasalo nayali yumwe wa wala wawele kuli chisaga hamwe na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Lelo, Maliya nakahola nusu lita ya mafuta galingununyhilila ga sendi nyinji ga nado, nakambakaliza Yesu kuli magulu na kumbagusa kwa mnvili za heye. Ng'handa yeng'ha naimema ununyhililo wa mafuta ago. <verse eid="JHN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Lelo, Yudasi Isikalioti, yumwe wa wala kumi na weli yawele ndo yombelenhuka Yesu, nakalonga, <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />“Lekachoni mafuta aga hagaguzigwe kwa sendi denali miya zidatu na sendi azo wapegwe wazunwa?” <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Yudasi nakalonga ahyo haiwele kwa vila nakawonela isungu wazunwa, ila kwa vila nayali yowika sendi na kwa vila nayali mhizi, chila mhela nayali yohiza koyawichile zila sendi. <verse eid="JHN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Ila Yesu nakalonga, “Mleche kumtunya ayu mdala! Mumleche yagawiche ago mafuta kwa chiwalo cha zuwa lya kutiligwa kwa heni. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Wazunwa mowa nawo mazuwa gose, ila hamuwa na heni mazuwa gose.”<verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kiwika goya kumkopola Lasalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Wayahudi wenji nawahulika kota Yesu nayali Betaniya. Lelo, nawafika ako haiwele kwa kumona Yesu, ila kumona Lasalo yawele Yesu nakamzilipula kulawa kwa wabagame. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Vilongozi wa watambika nawagana wamkopole Lasalo, <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />kwa vila kwa chiwalo cha Lasalo Wayahudi wenji nawawabelenhuka vilongozi wa hewo na kumkunda Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangwinjila Yelusalemu kwa luchenze</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matei 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Malichi 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Lukasi 19:28-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Zuwa liwinzile, lung'hongola lwa wanhu luyile kuli mnvina naluhulika kota Yesu nayali mzila kuya Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />Lelo, nawahola nhagala za mitende, nawaluta kumlamsa, nawakwiniza lizi wolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:13">“Lutogo! Yatambichizwe ayo yalinguya kwa itagwa lya Mkulu Nguluwi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:13">Yatogoligwe mndewa wa Isilaeli.”<verse eid="JHN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Yesu nakalipata lyana idogowi, nakakwina mchanya mwa alyo kota Maandiko Matakatifu vyogalingulonga.<verse eid="JHN 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />“Uleche kudumba, gwa mhinza Siyoni!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:15">Ulole, Mndewa wa hegwe kanguya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:15">lyana lya idogowi!”<verse eid="JHN 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Mhela awo walanguswa wa heye nahawavizelele mbuli azo, ila Yesu vyoyatogoligwe, aho nawakumbuchila kota ago nagali gandichigwe kuwala heye na wanhu nawali wamditile ahyo.<verse eid="JHN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Lung'hongola lwa wanhu wala wawele hamwe na Yesu mhela loyamchemile Lasalo kulawa kuli chilaga, nakamzilipula kulawa kwa wabagame, nawalutilila kulonga kuwala heye. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Ahyo lung'hongola alo naluluta kumlamsa, kwa vila weng'ha nawahulika kota Yesu nayali yaditile ulajilo awo. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Lelo, Mafalisayo nawelonjela, “Mwangulola? Hotuweza kudita choneche! Mlole, isi yeng'ha yangumuwinza.”<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wagilichi wamwe wangugana kumona Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Nakwali na Wagilichi wamwe hali wanhu wawele nawafika Yelusalemu kufugama mhela wa mnvina ayo. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Awo nawamlutila Filipo, mwenyeng'haye wa Betisaida kuli muji wa Galilaya, nawalonga, “Mkulu, twangugana kumona Yesu.” <verse eid="JHN 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Filipo nakaluta kumlonjela Andeleya, nawo weli nawaluta kumlonjela Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Yesu nakawalonjela, “Mhela wa kutogoligwa kwa Mwana wa munhu naufika! <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Ndikomya ndanguwalonjela, wone nyhule ya ngano haigwile hali misanga na kola yanguponaga nyhule hihila. Ila wone yole, yangulelaga nyhule nyinji. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Yalinguugana ukomu wa heye, kouwajiliza, naye yalinguuzudila ukomu wa heye kuli isi ayi, kouwika kwa chiwalo cha ukomu wa mazuwa gose. <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Yalingugana kung'holela mijito yangumgana yambinze, ahyo honeche hondili aho ndo chitumagwa wa heni hoyowa. Munhu yoneche yalingung'holela mijito, Mhaza wa heni komhulichiza.”<verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangulonga kuwala kubagama kwa heye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />“Lelo, nhumbula ya heni yangugazika, ndonje choni? Ndaze, ndonje, ‘Mhaza, uleche kukundiza mhela awu ufiche kwa heni?’ Hebu, nambuya kuli isi leka ng'hole kuli mhela uno. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Mhaza, litogole itagwa lya hegwe.” Aho lizi nalilonga kulawa kilanga, “Nandilitogola na ndolitogola kahi.”<verse eid="JHN 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Lung'hongola lwa wanhu wawele nawema aho nawahulika lizi alyo, wamwe wa hewo nawalonga, “Alyo ndo lizi lya lumwemwesa.” Ila wanji nawalonga, “Mhilisi nakalonga na heye!” <verse eid="JHN 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Ila Yesu nakawalonjela, “Lizi alo halulawile kwa chiwalo cha heni, ila kwa chiwalo cha hemwe. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Sambi ndo mhela wa isi ayi kutaguswa, lelo chilongozi wa isi ayi kobelenhukwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Nani hondikwinuligwa mchanya mwa isi ndomkwega chila yumwe kwa heni.” <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Kwa kulonga ahyo nakalajila ndaze vyoyobagama.<verse eid="JHN 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Lelo, lung'hongola lwa wanhu nalwidichila, “Twangulonjeligwa na malajizo ga hetwe kota Kilistu kochikala mazuwa gose. Kwanguweza ndaze kulonga kota Mwana wa munhu kanguganigwa yenuligwe? Ayo Mwana wa munhu ndo whaani?” <verse eid="JHN 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Yesu nakawalonjela, “Lumuli lung'hali kwa hemwe kwa mhela uchefu. Mjende mng'hali na lumuli alo leka jiza ileche kuwapata, kwa vila yalingujenda kuli jiza hambe yavizele koyalinguluta. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Lelo, kwa vila mwanalo lumuli muukunde leka muwe wanhu wa lumuli.” Loyasindile kulonga ulonzi awo, Yesu nakaluta na kivisa kutali na hewo.<verse eid="JHN 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu wahela makundo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Hanga Yesu nakalajila vinduzanduza avyo vyeng'ha hali hewo, hewo nahawamkundile. <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />Ahyo ulonzi woyalonjile Mloli Isaya nawenela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:38">“Mkulu, whaani yaukundile usenga wa hetwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:38">Na ludali lwa Mkulu Nguluwi nalulajilwa kwa whaani?”<verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Ahyo hawawezile kukunda, kwa vila Isaya kangulonga honhu hanji,<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />“Nguluwi nakagadinya meho ga hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">na kuzidita nhumbula za hewo zigagadale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">leka waleche kulola kwa meho gawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">ne kuvizela kwa nyhala za hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">leka waleche kuhinduka kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">leka ndiwalohole, yolonga Mkulu Nguluwi.”<verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Isaya nakalonga ulonzi awu kwa vila nakawona ukulu wa Yesu, nakalonga mbuli za heye.<verse eid="JHN 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Ahyo, vilongozi wenji wa Wayahudi nawamkunda Yesu. Ila kwa chiwalo cha Mafalisayo, nahawalonjile hazelu kwa kudumba kota wowinjigwa kuli sunagogi. <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />Nawagana kutogoligwa na wanhu kusinda kutoligwa na Nguluwi.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nakoya kuilohola isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Hamba Yesu nakalonga kwa lizi likulu, “Munhu yalingung'hunda, halingung'hunda heni yeka, ila kangumkunda kahi yandajize. <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />Yalingumbona heni kangumona kahi yandajize. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Heni ndo lumuli, nambuya kuli isi leka wanhu weng'ha walingung'hunda waleche kuwa kuli jiza. <verse eid="JHN 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />Yalinguuhulika ulonzi wa heni ila hambe yaubate, heni hambe ndimtaguse, kwa vila suyile kuitagusa isi ila kuilohola. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Yohambe yaubate ulonzi wa heni kanaye wa kumtagusa, ulonzi wula wondonjile ndo mtagusa wa heye kuli zuwa lya kuduma. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Silonjile kwa ludali lwa heni yeka, ila Mhaza yandajize nakandonjela choni cha kulonga na ndonje ndaze. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Nani ndanguvizela kota ilajizo lya heye lyangigala ukomu wa mazuwa gose. Lelo, ndangulonga gala Mhaza goyandajize ndigalonje.”<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguwahovuga magulu walanguswa wa heye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Zuwa limwe kung'hali mnvina ya Pasaka, Yesu nakavizela mhela wa heye wa kuka kuli isi na kuluta kwa Mhaza nawali ufichile. Nayali yawaganile lukami wanhu wa heye wawele kuli isi, ena, nakawagana mbaka kuduma.<verse eid="JHN 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Lelo, Yesu na walanguswa wa heye nawali wekalise kulya chilyo cha nechilo. Limazoga nalyali liwichile majesa mgati mwa Yuda mwana wa Simoni Isikalioti, ga kumbelenhuka Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Yesu nakavizela kota Mhaza nakamha chila chinhu, kavizela kota nayali yalawile kwa Nguluwi na kanguhiluka kwa Nguluwi. <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />Lelo, nakoka kuli chisaga, nakawika hafungo ivalo lya heye, nakahola chibende na kiwoha mchuno. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Hamba nakawika mazi kuli chisaye, nakaluka kuhovuga magulu ga walanguswa wa heye na kugabagusa kwa chila chibende choyewohile. <verse eid="JHN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Loyafichile kwa Simoni Petili, naye Petili nakamuuza, “Mkulu, ndaze, hegwe kohovuga magulu ga heni?” <verse eid="JHN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Yesu nakamwidichila, “Hauvizelele chondilingudita sambi, ila kovizela hamba.” <verse eid="JHN 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Petili nakamlonjela Yesu, “Hegwe huhovuga magulu ga heni!” Yesu nakamwidichila, “Wone sihovuga magulu ga hegwe, hauwa wa heni.” <verse eid="JHN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Aho Simoni Petili nakamwidichila, “Mkulu, nhyovuje, hagawele magulu hela, ila na moko ga heni na mutwi kahi.” <verse eid="JHN 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Yesu nakamlonjela “Yula yojile yangumgana yahovuje magulu hela, kwa vila lukuli lwa heye lweng'ha ndo lunoga. Hemwe ndo mnoga hanga hawele chila yumwe wa hemwe.” <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Yesu nakamzela yawele yombelenhuka, ndo chiwalo nakalonga, “Hemwe namnoga ila hamuwele weng'ha.”<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Yesu loyasindile kuwahovuga magulu na kuvala ivalo lya heye, nakahiluka hala hoyekalise hamwande, nakawauza “Ndaze, namvizela ago gondiwaditile?” <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />Hemwe mwangunyhema Mlangusa na Mkulu, mwangulonga goya, kwa vila ndo heni. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Lelo, wone heni ndiwele Mkulu na Mlangusa wa hemwe nandiwahovuga magulu, namwe mwanguganigwa chila yumwe yamuhovuje myage magulu. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Nandiwalajila nzila ya kudita, leka namwe mdite kota vyondiwaditile. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Ndikomya ndanguwalonjela, chitumagwa hawele mkulu kusinda chilongozi wa heye, ne mpogozi hawele mkulu kusinda yula yamlajize. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Lelo, wone mwangugazela ago, mobweda hala homgadita.<verse eid="JHN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />“Gondilingulonga hagali nguwawala hemwe mweng'ha. Ndanguwazela wala wondiwahagule. Ila ganguganigwa genele Maandiko Matakatifu galingulonga, ‘Yula yehanzile chilyo na heni nakambelenhuka heni.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />Nandiwalonjela mbuli azi sambi kung'hali hazinalawila, leka hozilawila, mkunde kota ‘Heni nda Heni.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Ndikomya ndanguwalonjela, yalingumbochela heye yondilingumlajiza, kangumbochela heni na yalingumbochela heni, kangumbochele yandajize.”<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangulavya uloli kota kobelenhukwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Matei 26:20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Malichi 14:17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Lukasi 22:21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Vyoyalonjile ago, Yesu nakadeula mnhumbula, nakalonga, “Ndikomya, ndikomya, ndanguwalonjela, yumwe wa hemwe kombelenhuka heni.”<verse eid="JHN 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Walanguswa wa heye nawelola ne kuvizela nayali yolonga kuwala whaani. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Yumwe wa walanguswa wa heye yawele Yesu nakamgana ng'hatu, nayali yekale habehi na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Lelo, Simoni Petili nakamha ulajilo yula mlanguswa, nakalonga, “Muuze kangulonga kuwala whaani.” <verse eid="JHN 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Yula mlanguswa nakahejela habehi ng'hatu na Yesu, nakamuuza, “Mkulu, ndo whaani?” <verse eid="JHN 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Yesu nakedichila, “Yula yondimha chihande cha ibumunda chondilize mchizombe, ndo heye.” Lelo, nakahola chihande cha ibumunda, nakadilizila kuli chizombe nakampa Yudasi, mwana wa Simoni Isikalioti. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Yudasi loyabochele chihande acho, Limazoga nalimwinjila. Lelo, Yesu nakamlonjela, “Chougana kudita, dite himahima!” <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Ila haduhu ne yumwe wa wala wekalise na heye hala mchisaga yawele nakavizela lekachoni nayali yamlonjele ahyo. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Kwa vila Yudasi nayali yowika sendi, wamwe wa hewo nawejesa kota Yesu nayali yamlonjele yagule vilinguganigwa kuli mnvina, ama nakamlonjela yalute kuwapa wazunwa choneche. <verse eid="JHN 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Lelo, Yudasi loyabochele chila chihande cha ibumunda baho du nakalawa mgati. Nayali nechilo.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mzilo unyale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Yudasi loyochile, Yesu nakalonga, “Lelo Mwana wa munhu nakelizwa, naye Nguluwi nakelizwa mgati mwa heye. <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />Wone ukulu wa Nguluwi naugubuligwa mgati mwa Mwana, lelo, naye Nguluwi koulajila ukulu wa Mwana mgati mwa heye yuye na baho du kodita ago.<verse eid="JHN 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />“Wana wa heni, nding'hali na hemwe kwa mhela uchefu hela. Momhala heni, ila sambi ndanguwalonjela gala gondiwalonjele vilongozi wa Wayahudi, ‘Kondiluta, hemwe hamuweza kuluta!’ <verse eid="JHN 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />Ndanguwapa mzilo unyale, migane mwemwe, migane kota vyondilinguwagana. <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Wone migane, wanhu weng'ha wovizela kota hemwe ndo walanguswa wa heni.”<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguwikula kota Petili kombela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matei 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Malichi 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Lukasi 22:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Simoni Petili nakamuuza Yesu, “Mkulu, kwanguluta kohi?” Yesu nakedichila, “Kondiluta hambe uweze kumbinza sambi, ila kombinza hamba.” <verse eid="JHN 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Petili nakamuuza, “Mkulu, lekachoni hambe mbeze kukuwinza sambi? Nda goya kubagama kwa chiwalo cha hegwe!” <verse eid="JHN 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Yesu nakedichila, “Ndaze, kukomya kota kobagama kwa chiwalo cha heni? Ndikomya ndangukulonjela, kung'hali izogolo halineka, kombela mala zidatu!”<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ndo nzila ya kuluta kwa Mhaza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />Yesu nakawalonjela, “Mleche kudeula mnhumbula za hemwe. Mumkunde Nguluwi na mng'hunde heni. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Kaye kwa Mhaza wa heni hana honhu hakulu ha kikala, wone haiwele ahyo, ndahawalonjele. Lelo ndanguluta kuwawichila goya honhu ha kikala. <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Wone ndute kuwawichila goya honhu ha kikala, ndohiluka na kuwahola, leka namwe muwe hala hondili. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Mwanguizela nzila ya kuluta ako kondiluta.”<verse eid="JHN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Tomasi nakamuuza, “Mkulu, hatukuzelele kouluta, lelo, toizela ndaze nzila ayo?” <verse eid="JHN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Yesu nakamwidichila, “Heni ndo nzila na kukomya na ukomu. Haduhu yalinguweza kuluta kwa Mhaza ila kwa kukolela kwa heni. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Wone mwangunzela, mwangumzela na Mhaza wa heni. Kulawila sambi mwangumzela, kahi nammona.”<verse eid="JHN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Filipo nakamlonjela, “Mkulu, utulajile ayo Mhaza, acho ndo tulinguchigana.” <verse eid="JHN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Yesu nakamlonjela, “Nandikala na hemwe mhela weng'ha awu, nagwe Filipo haunzelele? Yambwene heni nakamona Mhaza. Kwanguweza ndaze kulonga, ‘Tulajile Mhaza?’ <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />Ndaze, hambe ukunde kota heni nda mgati mwa Mhaza, naye Mhaza ka mgati mwa heni? Ulonzi wondilinguwalonjela hambe ndonje kwa ludali lwa heni, Mhaza yawele mgati mwa heni kangukola mijito jake. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Mwanguganigwa mng'hunde hondilonga kota heni nda mgati mwa Mhaza naye Mhaza ka mgati mwa heni. Wone haiwele ahyo, mkunde kwa chiwalo cha mbuli zondilingudita. <verse eid="JHN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />Ndikomya ndanguwalonjela, yalingung'hunda kodita mbuli zondilingudita heni, ena, kodita mbaka mbuli ng'hulu ng'hatu, kwa vila ndanguluta kwa Mhaza. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Choneche chomlanda kwa itagwa lya heni ndodita, leka Mhaza yapegwe ukulu mgati mwa Mwana. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Wone mlande chinhu choneche kwa itagwa lya heni, ndowaditila.<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muhe Yelile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />“Wone mwangungana, mojiwinza mizilo ja heni. <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />Nani ndomlanda Mhaza naye kowapa hemwe Mtanzi yunji, yawele yochikala na hemwe mazuwa gose. <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />Heye ndo Muhe wa kukomya. Isi haiweza kumbochela kwa vila haiweza kumona ne kumzela. Ila hemwe mwangumzela kwa vila ka hamwe na hemwe na ka mgati mwa hemwe.<verse eid="JHN 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />“Siwaleka muwe walekwa, ndokuya kahi kwa hemwe. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Naupona mhela uchefu nayo isi haimbona kahi, ila hemwe mombona, kwa vila heni nda mkomu, namwe mowa wakomu. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Zuwa lila holifika movizela kota heni nda mgati mwa Mhaza, namwe mwa mgati mwa heni, nani nda mgati mwa hemwe. <verse eid="JHN 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />Yalingujibochela mizilo ja heni na kujiwinza, heye ndo yalingungana. Naye yalingungana koganigwa na Mhaza wa heni, nani ndomgana na kilajila kwa heye.”<verse eid="JHN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Yudasi hawele yula Yudasi Isikalioti nakalonga, “Mkulu, yowa ndaze hegwe kilajila kwa heye na haiwele kwa isi?” <verse eid="JHN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Yesu nakamwidichila, “Wone munhu yangane kohulichiza ulonzi wa heni, Mhaza wa heni komgana, natwe tokuya kwa heye na kikala. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Yohambe yangane halinguhulichiza ulonzi wa heni. Ulonzi womuhuliche hauwele wa heni, ila wa Mhaza yandajize.<verse eid="JHN 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />“Nandiwalonjela mbuli azi mhela honding'hali hamwe na hemwe, <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />ila mtanzi, Muhe Yelile, yawele Mhaza komlajiza kwa itagwa lya heni, kowalangusa chila chinhu na kuwadita mkumbuchile chila chinhu chondiwalonjele.<verse eid="JHN 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />“Ndanguwalechela kikala goya, ndanguwapa kikala goya kwa heni. Hambe ndiwape hemwe kota hila isi vyoilingudita. Mleche kuwa na lunhwinhwi ne kudeula. <verse eid="JHN 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />Namuhulika ndiwalonjele, ‘Ndanguluta, hamba ndokuya kahi kwa hemwe.’ Wone mwahanganile, mwahasangalale kwa vila ndanguluta kwa Mhaza, kwa vila heye ndo mkulu kusinda heni. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Nandiwalonjela aga sambi kung'hali haganalawila, leka hogolawila mkunde. <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />Silonga na hemwe kahi mbuli nyinji, kwa vila chilongozi wa isi ayi kanguya. Kwa heni howeza chinhu, <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />ila isi yanguganigwa ivizele kota ndangumgana Mhaza, nani ndangudita gala Mhaza goyandajize. Mwime, tulawe hano!<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ndo mzabibu wa kukomya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />“Heni ndo mzabibu wa kukomya na Mhaza wa heni ndo mlimi. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Chila nhagala iwele mgati mwa heni yohambe ilele mafuza Mhaza wa heni kanguitemaga na chila nhagala ilingulela kanguidahulilaga leka ilele ng'hatu. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Hemwe namuwa goya kwa chiwalo cha usenga wondiwalonjele. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Mikale mgati mwa heni, nani mgati mwa hemwe. Kota hila nhagala vyohambe iweze kulela mafuza iliyeka wone haiwele kuli igodi lya mzabibu, hiho du namwe hambe muweze kulela mafuza wone hamuwa mgati mwa heni.”<verse eid="JHN 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />“Heni nda mzabibu, namwe ndo nhagala. Yalingikala mgati mwa heni, wone nani ndiwe mgati mwa heye, ayo kolela mafuza menji, kwa vila ne heni hamuweza kudita choneche. <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />Wone munhu yoneche yohambe yekale mgati mwa heni kangutajigwa kunze kota nhagala ilingutajigwa kunze mbaka yangukala. Wanhu wanguilokotaga nhagala ayo na kuitoza kuli chiluli leka ilakale. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Wone mikale mgati mwa heni na ulonzi wa heni wikale mgati mwa hemwe, mlande chinhu choneche chomlinguchigana namwe mopegwa. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Ukulu wa Mhaza wa heni wangonekaga hala homlela mafuza menji na kuwa walanguswa wa heni. <verse eid="JHN 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />Heni nandiwagana hemwe kota vila Mhaza vyoyanganile heni. Mikale kuli igano lya heni. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Wone mjibate mizilo ja heni mochikala kuli igano lya heni, kota vila vyondijibatilile mizilo ja Mhaza wa heni na kikala kuli igano lya heye. <verse eid="JHN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />Nandiwalonjela mbuli azi leka kusangalala kwa heni kuwe mgati mwa hemwe na kusangalala kwa hemwe kwenele. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />Awu ndo mzilo wa heni, migane, migane kota vyondiwaganile heni. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Haduhu igano likulu ng'hatu kusinda igano lya munhu yalinguulavya ukomu wa heye kwa chiwalo cha goloko wa heye. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Hemwe ndo goloko wa heni wone mdite vila vyondilinguwalajiza. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Hemwe hambe ndiwacheme kahi vitumagwa, kwa vila chitumagwa hambe yavizele choyalingudita mkulu wa heye. Ila heni nandiwachema hemwe goloko wa heni, kwa vila nandiwazelesa geng'ha gawele nandigahulika kulawa kwa Mhaza wa heni. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Hemwe hamnyhagule, heni nandiwahagula na kuwalajiza mlute kulela mafuza, mafuza galingikala mazuwa menji, naye Mhaza yawape choneche chomlingumlanda kwa itagwa lya heni. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Lelo, mzilo wa heni kwa hemwe ndo awu, migane.”<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isi yanguwazudila walanguswa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />“Wone isi yowazudila hemwe, mkumbuchile kota nainzudila heni kung'hali haiwazudile hemwe. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Wone mwahawele wanhu wa isi, isi yahawaganile kota wanhu wa heye. Kwa vila hamuwele wa isi, ila heni nandiwahagula kulawa kuli isi, achi ndo chiwalo isi yanguwazudila. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />Mkumbuchile vyondiwalonjele, chitumagwa hawele mkulu kusinda mkulu wa heye. Wone nawangaza heni, wowagaza na hemwe kahi, wone nawahulichiza ulonzi wa heni, wouhulichiza na ulonzi wa hemwe. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Ila ago geng'ha wowaditila hemwe kwa chiwalo cha itagwa lya heni, kwa vila hawamzelele yandajize. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Wone nasalikuya na kulonga na hewo, hanawalikuwa na gehile, ila sambi hawoweza kilewela kota wahela gehile. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />Yalingunzudila heni, kangumzudila na Mhaza wa heni kahi. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Wone nasalidita kwa hewo mbuli ziwele haduhuli munhu yunji nakazidita hanawalikuwa na nongwa, ila sambi nawagona gonditile nawanzudila, nawamzudila na Mhaza wa heni kahi. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Ila nawadita ahi leka kweneza ulonzi wowandichigwe kuli chitabu cha malajizo, ‘Nawanzudila hihi hela!’<verse eid="JHN 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />“Hoyokuya ayo Mtanzi yondimlajiza kwa hemwe kulawa kwa Mhaza, ayo Muhe wa kukomya, yalingulawa kwa Mhaza, heye kondonjela. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Namwe kahi mondonjela kwa vila namwali na heni kulawila mwaluko.”<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />“Nandiwalonjela ago leka mleche kugaleka makundo ga hemwe. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Wanhu wowawinga hemwe kuli masunagogi ga hewo. Kahi, mhela wanguya uwele chila hoyowakopola hemwe kochijesa kota kangumkolela mijito Nguluwi. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Wowaditila mbuli azo kwa vila hawamzelele Mhaza ne kunzela heni. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Lelo, nandiwalonjela mbuli azi leka mhela wa heye houfika mkumbuchile kota nandiwalonjela. Siwalonjele mbuli azo kulawila mwaluko kwa vila nandali hamwe na hemwe.<verse eid="JHN 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mijito ja Muhe Yelile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />“Ila sambi ndanguluta kwa heye yandajize, haduhu ne yumwe wa hemwe yalingumbuza, ‘Kwanguluta kohi?’ <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Kwa vila ndiwalonjela mbuli azi nammema masinzo kuli nhumbula za hemwe. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Ila, ndanguwalonjela ndikomya, fola heni mbuche, kwa vila wone silutile Mtanzi hokuya kwa hemwe. Ila wone ndute, ndomlajiza yoye kwa hemwe. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Naye hoyokuya kowalajila wanhu wa kuli isi kota nawadita vibi kuwala gehile na hachi na utaguso wa Nguluwi. <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />Nawadita vibi kuwala gehile kwa vila hambe wang'hunde, <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />kuwala hachi, kwa vila ndanguluta kwa Mhaza, namwe hambona kahi, <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />kuwala utaguso, kwa vila chilongozi wa isi ayi mana nakatagusigwa.<verse eid="JHN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />“Ndanazo mbuli nyinji za kuwalonjela, ila sambi hamuweza kwimilila. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Ila hoyokuya ayo Muhe wa kukomya kowalongoza kuli kukomya, kwa vila holonga kwa ludali lwa heye yuye, ila kolonga gala goyohulika na kuwazelesa mbuli zilinguya. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Heye konhogola kwa vila kogahola gawele ga heni na kuwazelesa hemwe. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Vyeng'ha vyoyawelenavyo Mhaza ndo vya heni, kwa chiwalo achi nandonga kota ayo Muhe kogahola gawele ga heni na kuwazelesa hemwe.<verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Masinzo na kusangalala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />“Ung'hali mhela uchefu namwe hammbona na loukola mhela uchefu mombona kahi.” <verse eid="JHN 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Wamwe walanguswa wa heye naweuza, “Kana mana yachi hoyotulonjela, ‘Ung'hali mhela uchefu hammbona na houkola mhela uchefu mombona kahi?’ Kahi kangulonga, ‘Kwa vila ndanguluta kwa Mhaza!’ ” <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />Lelo, nawali wochiuza, “Kana mana yachi hoyolonga, ‘Ung'hali mhela uchefu?’ Hatuvizelele choyolonga.” <verse eid="JHN 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Yesu nakavizela kota wangugana kumuuza, lelo nakawalonjela, “Mwangiuza kuwala gala gondonjile, ‘Ung'hali mhela uchefu hammbona na houkola mhela uchefu mombona kahi?’ <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Ndanguwalonjela kukomya, hemwe molila na kulombocheza, ila isi yosangalala, mowa na masinzo ila masinzo ga hemwe gogaluka kusangalala. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Mhela wa kuponda kwa mamo kanguwaga na masinzo kwa vila mhela wa usungu naufika, ila hoyoponda hambe yaukumbuchile kahi usungu awo kwa chiwalo cha kusangalala kwa kupondigwa kwa munhu kuli isi. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Sambi namwe muna masinzo, ila ndokuya kwa hemwe kahi, namwe mowa na usangalalo mnhumbula za hemwe na usangalalo awo haduhu munhu yowusa kwa hemwe. <verse eid="JHN 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />Zuwa alyo hamlanda choneche kwa heni. Ndikomya ndanguwalonjela, choneche chomlanda kwa Mhaza kwa itagwa lya heni, kowapa. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Mbaka sambi hamlandile choneche kwa itagwa lya heni. Mlande namwe mopegwa leka usangalalo wa hemwe wenele.<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kikalagoya kwa walanguswa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />“Nandiwalonjela mbuli azo kwa nhelo. Ila mhela wanguya uwele silonga na hemwe kahi kwa nhelo, ila ndowalonjela hazelu kuwala Mhaza. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Zuwa alyo molanda kwa itagwa lya heni, hambe ndiwalonjele kota ndomlanda Mhaza kwa chiwalo cha hemwe, <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />kwa vila heye yuye kanguwagana hemwe, kwa vila hemwe namngana heni na kukunda kota nandawa kwa Nguluwi. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Heni nandawa kwa Mhaza, nambuya kuli isi na sambi ndanguileka isi na kuhiluka kwa Mhaza.”<verse eid="JHN 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Walanguswa wa heye nawamlonjela, “Lelo kwangulonga hazelu ne kulonga kwa nhelo. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Lelo twanguvizela kota hegwe kwanguvizela chila chinhu na hambe uganigwe kuuzigwa na munhu yoneche, ahyo twangukunda kota nakulawa kwa Nguluwi.”<verse eid="JHN 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Yesu nakawedichila, “Ndaze, mwangukunda sambi? <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />Mhela wanguya, kahi naufika, uwele hemwe weng'ha mosambalulwa chila yumwe kwa heye, nani ndolechigwa ndiliyeka. Ila heni siwele ndiliyeka, kwa vila Mhaza ka hamwe na heni. <verse eid="JHN 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />Ndanguwalonjela mbuli azi leka muwe na kikala goya kuli kilumba na heni. Kuli isi motunyigwa, ila mikangaze nhumbula! Heni nandiisumya isi!”<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kangulanda kwa chiwalo cha walanguswa wa heye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Yesu loyasindile kulonga ago, nakalola kilanga, nakalonga, “Mhaza, ula mhela naufika! Umhe ukulu Mwanago leka naye Mwana yakupe ukulu. <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />Kwa vila nakumha Mwanago ludali kwa wanhu weng'ha leka yawape ukomu wa mazuwa gose awo woumpele. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Ukomu wa mazuwa gose ndo awu, kukuzele hegwe uwele uliyeka Nguluwi wa kukomya na kumzela Yesu Kilistu youmlajize. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />Heni nandikupa ukulu kuli isi ayi, nanyeneza mijito joundaajize ndijikole. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Lelo, Mhaza, unhogole hali hegwe kwa ula ukulu wombele nawo kung'hali kulumbigwa kwa isi.<verse eid="JHN 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />“Nandikudita uzeleche kwa wanhu wala woumhele kulawa kuli isi. Nawali wanhu wa hegwe, nagwe nakumha heni, nawo nawebatilila ulonzi wa hegwe. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Sambi wanguvizela kota chila choumha heni changulawa kwa hegwe. <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />Nandiwapa wula usenga woumhele, nawo nawaubochela. Wanguvizela kota ndikomya nandawa kwa hegwe na wangukunda kota hegwe nakundajiza.<verse eid="JHN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />“Ndangulanda kwa chiwalo cha awo, hambe ndande kwa chiwalo cha isi, ila ndangulanda kwa chiwalo cha awo woumhele, kwa vila ndo wa hegwe. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Geng'ha gondilinago ndo ga hegwe na ga hegwe ndo ga heni na ukulu wa heni nawoneka hali awo woumhele. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Lelo ndanguya kwa hegwe, siwele kahi kuli isi, ila hewo wa kuli isi. Mhaza Welile! Kwa ludali wa itagwa lya hegwe lyoumhele uwamile leka wawe chinhu chimwe kota hetwe vyotuwele hamwe. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Londiwele nawo, nandiwawika goya kwa ludali lwa itagwa lya hegwe lyoumhele. Heni nandiwamila, haduhu ne yumwe wa hewo yajilile, ila yula mwana yahaguligwe kwajilila leka Maandiko Matakatifu genele. <verse eid="JHN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />Lelo, ndanguya kwa hegwe, nandonga mbuli azi kuli isi leka wawe na usangalalo wa heni mgati mwa hewo. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />Nandiwapa usenga wa hegwe, nayo isi naiwazudila kwa vila hewo hawawele wa isi, kota hila heni vyosiwele wa isi. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Silingulanda uwose kuli isi, ila ndangulanda uwamile na lila Limazoga. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Hewo hawawele wa isi, kota hila heni vyosiwele wa isi. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Uwawiche chiuyeng'ha, ulonzi wa hegwe ndo kukomya. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Kota vila vyoundajize kuli isi, nani nandiwalajiza hewo kuli isi, <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />kwa chiwalo cha hewo heni ndangiwika chiuyeng'ha leka nawo wawichigwe chiuyeng'ha kuli kukomya.<verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />“Silingulanda kwa chiwalo cha hewo yeka, ila ndangulanda kwa chiwalo cha weng'ha howokunda kwa kiwhana na usenga wa hewo. <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />Ndangulanda leka weng'ha wawe chinhu chimwe. Mhaza! Ndangulanda wawe mgati mwa hetwe kota hila hegwe vyouwele mgati mwa heni nani mgati mwa hegwe. Ndangulanda wawe chinhu chimwe leka isi ikunde kota hegwe nakundajiza. <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />Nandiwapa ukulu wuwula woumhele leka wawe chinhu chimwe kota hetwe vyotuwele hamwe, <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />heni ndiwe mgati mwa hewo, nagwe uwe mgati mwa heni, leka wenele na wawe chinhu chimwe, leka isi ivizele kota nakundajiza na kwanguwagana kota vyoulingungana.<verse eid="JHN 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />“Mhaza! Ndangugana awo woumhele wawe hamwe na heni hala hondili, leka wawone ukulu wa heni woumhele, kwa vila nakungana kung'hali kulumbigwa kwa isi. <verse eid="JHN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />Mhaza Unojile! Isi haikuzelele, ila heni ndangukuzela. Awa nawo wanguvizela kota hegwe nakundajiza. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Nandikudita uzeleche kwa hewo na ndolutilila kudita ahyo, leka igano lyouwele nalyo kwa heni liwe mgati mwa hewo, nani ndiwe mgati mwa hewo.”<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kangibatigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matei 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Malichi 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Lukasi 22:47-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Yesu loyasindile kulonga ago, nakaluta hamwe na walanguswa wa heye kumwambu mwa kazanda ka Kediloni. Honhu aho nahali na kagunda, naye Yesu nakenjila amo hamwe na walanguswa wa heye. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Yudasi, yambelenhuche Yesu, nakahazela honhu aho kwa vila mala nyinji Yesu nayali yochiting'hana na walanguswa wa heye aho. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Lelo, Yudasi nakachilongoza chilundo cha wamizi kulawa kwa watambika wakulu na Mafalisayo, nawoya kuli kagunda kuno wawele na vyenje na vinhu vya kitowela ngondo. <verse eid="JHN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Yesu nakagazela geng'ha gawele gomlawila, nakaluta kwa hewo, nakawauza, “Mwangumpala whaani?” <verse eid="JHN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Nawo nawamwidichila, “Yesu wa Nasaleti!” Yesu nakawalonjela, “Heni ndo nene.” Yudasi, yawele nakamhinduka Yesu nayali yemile hamwe na hewo.<verse eid="JHN 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Lelo, Yesu loyawalonjele, “Heni ndo nene,” nawahiluka kumbele na kugwa. <verse eid="JHN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Yesu nakawauza kahi, “Mwangumpala whaani?” Nawamwidichila, “Yesu wa Nasaleti!” <verse eid="JHN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Yesu nakawalonjela, “Nandiwalonjela kota heni ndo nene. Lelo, wone mwangumhala heni, muwaleche awa walute.” <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />Nakalonga ago leka wenele wula ulonzi woyalonjile, “Simwajilize ne yumwe hali wala umhele.” <verse eid="JHN 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Simoni Petili nayali na ipanga, lelo, nakalisomola, nakamdumula ikutu lya kudilo lya chitumagwa wa mtambika mkulu. Chitumagwa ayo nakachemigwa Malichi. <verse eid="JHN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Lelo, Yesu nakamlonjela Petili, “Uhiluse ipanga lyako kuli yala. Ndaze, ndeche kunwa chizombe cha magazo choyamhele Mhaza?”<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kumwando kwa mtambika mkulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Chila chilundo cha wamizi chiwele hamwe na vilongozi na wamizi wa Wayahudi nawamibata Yesu na kumuwoha <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />na kuhilika kwa Anasi, mkweye Kayafa yawele nayali mtambika mkulu kuli mwaka awo. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Ayo Kayafa nayali yawalonjele Wayahudi kota naimgana munhu yumwe yabagame kwa chiwalo cha wanhu.<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petili kangumbela Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-70">Matei 26:69-70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Malichi 14:66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Lukasi 22:55-57</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Simoni Petili hamwe na mlanguswa yunji nawamuwinza Yesu. Ayo mlanguswa yunji nayali yozeleka na mtambika mkulu, ahyo nakenjila hamwe na Yesu kuli lugagala lwa mtambika mkulu. <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />Ila Petili nayali yemile hanze, habehi na lwizi. Lelo, ayo mlanguswa yunji yawele yozeleka na mtambika mkulu nakalawa hanze nakalonga na yalingwamila lwizi, nakamkundiza Petili yenjile mgati. <verse eid="JHN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Yalingwamila lwizi nakamuuza Petili, “Ndaze, nagwe kwa yumwe wa mlanguswa wa munhu ayu?” Petili nakamwidichila, “Siwele heni!”<verse eid="JHN 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Vitumagwa na wamizi nawali wabwinhile chiluli kwa vila nakwali na chipute, nawali wokota chiluli. Naye Petili nayali yemile hamwe na hewo yokota chiluli.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mtambika mkulu kangumuuza Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Matei 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Malichi 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Lukasi 22:66-71</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Lelo, mtambika mkulu nakamuuza Yesu kuwala walanguswa wa heye na malanguso ga heye. <verse eid="JHN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Yesu nakamwidichila, “Nandonga hazelu na chila munhu. Chila mhela nandangusa kuli masunagogi na kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi, honhu howalingiting'hana Wayahudi weng'ha na silonjile chinhu choneche kwa uviso. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Lekachoni kwangumbuza? Uwauze wala wawele nawahulika choni chondiwalonjele. Hewo wanguvizela gondiwalonjele.” <verse eid="JHN 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Loyalonjile ago mwamizi yumwe yawele nakema aho nakamsubula kuno yolonga, “Ndaze, ahi ndo vyoumwidichila mtambika mkulu?” <verse eid="JHN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Yesu nakamwidichila, “Wone nandonga vibi, ulajile awo wihe, ila wone nandonga goya, lekachoni kwangugubula?” <verse eid="JHN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Lelo, Anasi nakamhilika Yesu yawele yawohigwe, kwa mtambika mkulu yalinguchemigwa Kayafa.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petili kangumbela Yesu kahi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Matei 26:71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Malichi 14:69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Lukasi 22:58-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Simoni Petili nayali aho yokota chiluli. Lelo, nawamuuza, “Ndaze, nagwe hauwele yumwe wa walanguswa wa heye?” Heye nakabela na kulonga, “Siwele heni!” <verse eid="JHN 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Yumwe wa vitumagwa wa mtambika mkulu, mng'holoze yula yatemigwe ikutu na Petili, nakamuuza, “Ndaze, sikuwene kula kuli kagunda hamwe na heye?” <verse eid="JHN 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Petili nakabela kahi, baho du izogolo nalika.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguhilikwa kwa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Matei 27:1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Malichi 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Lukasi 23:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Lelo, nawamhola Yesu kulawa kwa Kayafa, nawamigala kuli ng'handa ya mndewa. Nayali lufuku, leka waleche kukokomoka kwa kiwhana na chihendo cha kulanda, Wayahudi nahawenjile mgati kwa chiwalo cha malajizo gawo. Wahoneche kota nawakokomoka wone nawenjile kuli ng'handa ya munhu hawele Myahudi na hawali kundizwa kihanza kuli mnvina ya Pasaka. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Ahyo, Pilato nakalawa mgati, nakawauza, “Namigala ulonjelezi wachi kuwala munhu ayu?” <verse eid="JHN 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Nawamwidichila, “Wone munhu ayu nahawele mwihe hatwali kumigala kwa hegwe.” <verse eid="JHN 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Pilato nakawalonjela, “Mumhole hemwe, mkamtaguse kwa kiwhana na malajizo ga hemwe.” Wayahudi nawamwidichila, “Hetwe twahela ludali lwa kumtagusa munhu yoneche.” <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Nawalonga ahyo leka wula ulonzi woyalonjile Yesu kuwala ndaze vyoyobagama wenele. <verse eid="JHN 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Pilato nakenjila kahi mgati mwa ng'handa ya chiundewa, nakamchema Yesu na kumuuza, “Hegwe ndo mndewa wa Wayahudi?” <verse eid="JHN 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Yesu nakamwidichila, “Ndaze, awo ndo ulonzi wa hegwe ama wanji nawakulonjela mbuli za heni?” <verse eid="JHN 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Pilato nakamwidichila, “Ndaze, heni nda Myahudi? Wanhu wa isi ya hegwe na wakulu wa watambika nawakigala kwa heni. Nakudita wihe wachi?” <verse eid="JHN 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Yesu nakamwidichila, “Undewa wa heni hauwele wa isi ino. Wone undewa wa heni wahawele wa isi ino, vitumagwa wa heni wahandewele leka ndeche kibatigwa na Wayahudi. Ila undewa wa heni hauwele wa kuli isi.” <verse eid="JHN 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Pilato nakamuuza, “Lelo, hegwe kwa mndewa?” Yesu nakamwidichila, “Hegwe kwangulonga kota heni nda mndewa. Heni namhondigwa kwa chiwalo acho na kwa chiwalo acho nambuya kuli isi kuwalonjela wanhu kuwala kukomya. Chila munhu wa kukomya kangunyhulichizaga.” <verse eid="JHN 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Pilato nakamuuza, “Kukomya ndo chinhu chachi?”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 18:38">Yesu kangutagusigwa kubagama</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 18:38">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Matei 27:15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Malichi 15:6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Lukasi 23:13-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Pilato loyalonjile ago, nakaluta kunze kwa Wayahudi, nakawalonjela, “Hambe mbone nongwa yoneche kwa heye. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Ila, mwanacho chihendo kota ndimdohole mnweng'wa yumwe kuli mhela wa Pasaka. Lelo, mwangugana ndimchumulile Mndewa wa Wayahudi?” <verse eid="JHN 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Aho nawatowa iyowe, “Hebu! Hawele ayu ila Balaba!” Naye Balaba nayali yalinguboka.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Lelo, Pilato nakakundiza Yesu yaholigwe, yazapigwe ng'hobwa. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Wamizi nawabota itaji lya miwa, nawamvaliza kumutwi na nawamvaliza ikanzu lya zambalau. <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />Nawali woluta hali heye na kulonga, “Ulamche, Mndewa wa Wayahudi!” Kuno womzabula kumeho. <verse eid="JHN 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Pilato nakalawa kunze kahi, nakawalonjela, “Mlole, ndangumlavya Yesu kwa hemwe leka mvizele kota siiwene nongwa yoneche kwa heye.” <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Lelo, Yesu nakalawa kunze kuno yavalile itaji lya miwa na ikanzu lya lanji ya zambalau. Pilato nakawalonjela, “Mlole, munhu ayo ndo ayu.” <verse eid="JHN 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Watambika wakulu na wamizi lowamuwene nawakwiniza lizi, “Muwambe! Muwambe!” Pilato nakawalonjela, “Mumhole hemwe leka mumuwambe, kwa vila heni siiwene nongwa yoneche kwa heye.” <verse eid="JHN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Wayahudi nawamwidichia, “Hetwe twanalyo ilajizo, kwa kuwinza ilajizo alyo, yangumgana yabagame kwa vila nakedita kota Mwana wa Nguluwi.” <verse eid="JHN 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Pilato loyahuliche ulonzi awo nakalutilila kudumba. <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />Nakenjila kahi mgati mwa ng'handa ya chiundewa, nakamuuza Yesu, “Nakulawa kohi hegwe?” Ila Yesu hamwidichile ne chinhu. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Ahyo Pilato nakamlonjela, “Kwangulema kulonga na heni? Huvizelele kota ndanalo ludali lwa kukulechela na ludali lwa kukuwamba?” <verse eid="JHN 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Yesu nakamwidichila, “Kwahela ludali lwoneche kwa heni, ila lula loupegwe na Nguluwi kulawa kuchanya. Kwa chiwalo acho, yula yengale kwa hegwe kana gehile ng'hatu.” <verse eid="JHN 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Kulawila aho Pilato nayali yopala ndaze vyoyomlechela Yesu, ila Wayahudi nawatowa iyowe, “Wone umlechele ayu munhu, huwele goloko wa mndewa wa Loma, kwa vila chila munhu yalingidita kota mndewa kangumbezaga mndewa wa Loma.” <verse eid="JHN 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Lelo, Pilato loyahuliche ulonzi awo, nakamigala Yesu kunze, nakekalisa kuli chigoda cha kutagusila, honhu halinguchemigwa, “Sakafu ya Maganga.” Kwa Chiebulaniya nahachemigwa Gabata.<verse eid="JHN 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Nayali kota saa sita nemisi, zuwa lya kiwika goya kwa mnvina ya Pasaka. Pilato nakawalonjela Wayahudi, “Mlole, ayu ndo Mndewa wa hemwe!” <verse eid="JHN 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Hewo nawakwiniza lizi, “Muse! Muse! Muwambe!” Pilato nakawauza, “Ndaze, ndimuwambe Mndewa wa hemwe?” Watambika wakulu nawamwidichila, “Twahela mndewa ila mndewa wa Loma hela!” <verse eid="JHN 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Aho Pilato nakamleka Yesu kwa hewo leka wamuwambe.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 19:16">Yesu kanguwambigwa</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 19:16">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matei 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Malichi 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Lukasi 23:26-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Lelo, nawamhola Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Yesu yawele yedwichile msalaba wa heye kuluta honhu halinguchemigwa Izeje lya Mutwi, kwa Chiebulaniya Goligota. <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Aho ndo honhu howamuwambile Yesu hamwe na wanhu wanji weli, yumwe kuli ubanzi wa heye wa kudilo na yunji kuli ubanzi wa kumoso, naye Yesu nayali hagati. <verse eid="JHN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Pilato nakalonga wandichigwe ulonzi na kuwichigwa mchanya mwa msalaba. Nawo nawandichigwa ahi, “Yesu Mnasaleti, Mndewa wa Wayahudi.” <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Wayahudi wenji nawausoma ulonzi awo, kwa vila honhu aho hoyawambigwe Yesu nahali habehi na muji. Ulonzi awo nawali wandichigwe kwa Chiebulaniya na Chilatini na Chigilichi. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Lelo, watambika wakulu nawamlonjela Pilato, “Uleche kwandika ‘Mndewa wa Wayahudi,’ Ila ‘Heye nakalonga, Heni nda Mndewa wa Wayahudi.’ ” <verse eid="JHN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Pilato nakedichila, “Chonyandiche ndo chicho!”<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Wamizi lowasindile kumuwamba Yesu, nawajihola mivalo ja heye, nawajigawa kuli vilundo vine, chila mwamizi chilundo chimwe. Nawalihola kahi ikanzu lyake, ikanzu alyo nalyali libotigwe kwa chihande chimwe hela kulawa kuchanya mbaka hanyi. <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Lelo, awo wamizi nawalongasa, “Tuleche kulidega ila tulitowele simbi leka tulole lyowa lya whaani.” Mbuli ayo naikoleka leka genele Maandiko Matakatifu galingulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 19:24">“Nawegawila mivalo ja heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 19:24">na ikanzu lya heni nawalitowela simbi.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">Ahyo ndo vyowaditile wala wamizi.<verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Habehi na msalaba wa Yesu nawali wemile Maliya yawele ndo mayake Yesu na lumbu wa mayake na Maliya mche wa Kileopa na Maliya Madelena. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Yesu loyamuwene mayake honhu hala hamwe na mlanguswa wa heye yamganile, nakamlonjela mayake, “Mamo! Ulole, ayo ndo mwanago.” <verse eid="JHN 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Kahi nakamlonjela yula mlanguswa, “Ulole, ayo ndo mayako.” Kulawila mhela awo yula mlanguswa nakamhola mayake Yesu leka yekale hakaye hake.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangubagama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matei 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Malichi 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Lukasi 23:44-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Hamba, Yesu nakavizela kota geng'ha nagali genela, leka Maandiko Matakatifu genele, nakalonga, “Ndina ng'halu.” <verse eid="JHN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Aho nakwali na chisaye chimemile sichi. Lelo, nawaihola ayo sichi kwa ibofyabofya liwopigwe kuli nhagala ya igodi lya isopolo na kumuwichila Yesu kumlomo. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Loyaijezile ayo sichi, Yesu nakalonga, “Nagenela!” Hamba nakenamiza, nakabagama.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguhomigwa na igoha mlubavu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Nayali zuwa lya Kiwika goya na Pasaka, Wayahudi nahawaganile ng'huli zikale kuli misalaba Zuwa lya Kwesela kwa vila zuwa alyo lyahawele mnvina. Ahyo nawamlanda Pilato yalavye mzilo magulu ga wanhu awo wawele nawawambigwa gabenigwe leka wabagame himahima na ng'huli zawo zusigwe kuli misalaba. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Lelo, wamizi nawaluta, nawabena magulu ga munhu wa mwaluko na wa keli wawele nawawambigwa hamwe na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Ila lowafichile kwa Yesu, nawona kota nayali yabagame, ahyo hawambenile magulu. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Ila mwamizi yumwe nakamhoma mlubavu na igoha baho du nailawa danda na mazi. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Munhu yagonile ago ndo yalonjile, kulonga kwa heye ndo kukomya, naye nakalonga leka namwe mkunde. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Mbuli ayo naikoleka leka Maandiko Matakatifu genele, “Haduhu ne izeje limwe lya heye lyobenigwa.” <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Kahi Maandiko ganji gangulonga, “Womlola yula wamtubule.”<verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangutiligwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matei 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Malichi 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Lukasi 23:50-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Logakolile ago, Yusufu, mwenyeng'haye wa Alimataya nakamlanda Pilato yamkundize kuluhola lukuli lwa Yesu. Yusufu nayali yumwe wa walanguswa wa Yesu, hanga kwa uviso kwa vila nakawadumba vilongozi wa Wayahudi. Lelo, Pilato nakamkundiza. Ahyo Yusufu nakaluta, nakuluhola lukuli lwa Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Naye Nikodemo yawele aho hamwande nayali yalutile kwa Yesu nechilo, nakoya kuno yawele na unhunyhililo na ubani chasi cha kilo makumi gadatu. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Ahyo nawaluhola lukuli lwa Yesu na kuluwoha kwa sanda ya kitani inojile hamwe na unhunyhililo kwa kiwhana na chihendo cha Wayahudi kuli kutila. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Honhu aho howamuwambile Yesu nahali na kagunda, kuli kagunda ako nakwali na chilaga chinyale chiwele ching'hali kutiligwa lukuli mgati mwake. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Lelo, kwa chiwalo cha mijito ja Wayahudi ja kuwika goya zuwa lya kwesela na kwa vila chilaga acho nachali habehi, nawalutila lukuli lwa Yesu amo.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s">Kuzilipuka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Matei 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Malichi 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Lukasi 24:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Lufuku zuwa lya mwaluko lya juma, Maliya Madelena nakaluta kuli chilaga, nakalyona lila iganga lyusigwe hali lwizi lwa chilaga. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Lelo, nakaluta kuno yobilima mbaka kwa Simoni Petili na kwa yula mlanguswa yunji yawele Yesu nakamgana, nakawalonjela, “Nawamusa Mkulu kuli chilaga ne hatuvizelele kohi nawamuwika.” <verse eid="JHN 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Petili hamwe na yula mlanguswa yunji nawaluta kuli chilaga. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Weng'ha weli nawaluta kuno wobilima, ila yula mlanguswa yunji nakabilima lukami kusinda Petili, nakalongola kufika kuli chilaga. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />Loyenamize na kusunjilila mgati nakona sanda, ila henjile mgati. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Simoni Petili nakoya yomuwinza, nakenjila kuli chilaga, amo nakayona sanda, <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />na chila chibende choyawopigwe Yesu kumutwi. Chibende acho hachiwichigwe hamwe na yila sanda, ila nachali chibinigwe na kuwichigwa chiliyeka. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Hamba yula mlanguswa yunji yawahiche kufika kuli chilaga, nakenjila mgati, nakona, nakakunda. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />Nawali wang'hali kuvizela Maandiko Matakatifu vyogalonjile kota naimgana kuzilipuka kulawa kwa wabagame. <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Lelo, awo walanguswa nawahiluka kaye.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kagumlawila Maliya Magidalena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Matei 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Malichi 16:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Maliya nayali yemile habehi na chilaga kuno yolila. Mhela loyawele yolila, nakenamiza na kusunjilila kuli chilaga, <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />nakawona wahilisi weli wavalile mivalo mizelu, wekalise hala houlambalikwe lukuli lwa Yesu, yumwe kumutwi na yunji kuli magulu. <verse eid="JHN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Awo wahilisi nawamuuza, “Mamo, lekachoni kwangulila?” Naye nakawedichila, “Nawamusa Mkulu wa heni, sivizelele nawamuwika kohi!”<verse eid="JHN 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Loyasindile kulonga ago, nakagalamka, nakamona Yesu yemile, ila nahavizelele kota ndo Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Yesu nakamuuza, “Mamo, lekachoni kwangulila? Kwangumpala whaani?” Maliya nakejesa kota munhu ayo nayali mlolezi wa kagunda, nakamlonjela, “Mkulu, wone ndo hegwe uwele nakumusa, undonjele kohi koumuwichile, nani ndoluta kumhola.” <verse eid="JHN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Yesu nakamlonjela, “Maliya!” Naye Maliya nakagalamka, nakamlonjela kwa Chiebulaniya, “Laboni!” Mina ndo “Mlangusa.” <verse eid="JHN 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Yesu nakamlonjela, “Uleche kimbata, kwa vila nding'hali kuluta kilanga kwa Mhaza. Ila ulute kwa wang'holozangu uwalonjele, ndanguluta kilanga kwa Mhaza wa heni yawele ndo Mhaza wa hemwe, Nguluwi wa heni yawele ndo Nguluwi wa hemwe.” <verse eid="JHN 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Ahyo Maliya Madelena nakaluta kuwalonjela walanguswa wa Yesu kota nakamona Mkulu, naye nayali yamlonjele mbuli azo zeng'ha.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguwalawila walanguswa wa heye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matei 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Malichi 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Lukasi 24:36-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Loiwele matinazo ya zuwa alyo lya mwaluko, walanguswa nawali weting'hane mgati mwa ng'handa na lwizi najali jihindigwe kwa vila nawawadumba vilongozi wa Wayahudi. Lelo, Yesu nakoya, nakema hali hewo, nakawalonjela, “Mikale goya!” <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Loyasindile kulonga ago, nakawalajila moko ga heye na lubavu lwake. Lelo, awo walanguswa nawasangalala ng'hatu kumona Mkulu. <verse eid="JHN 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Yesu nakawalonjela kahi, “Mikale goya! Kota vila Mhaza vyoyandajize, nani ndanguwalajiza hemwe.” <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Loyasindile kulonga ago, nakawaputila na kuwalonjela, “Mbochele Muhe Yelile. <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Wone muwalechele gehile ga hewo, wolechelwa, wone hamuwalechela gehile ga hewo, hawolechelwa.”<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Tomasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Tomasi yumwe wa wala kumi na weli, yalinguchemigwa mnyambili hawele hamwe na hewo mhela Yesu loyoyile. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Lelo, wala walanguswa wanji nawamlonjela, “Natumona Mkulu!” Tomasi nakawalonjela, “Sikunda mbaka ndizone ng'hovu za misumali kuli moko ga heye na kwinjiza chidole cha heni kuli ng'hovu azo na kwinjiza moko wa heni mlubavu lwa heye.”<verse eid="JHN 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Lelo, logakolile mazuwa nane awo walanguswa nawali hamwe kahi mla mng'handa na Tomasi nayali hamwe na hewo. Lwizi najali jihindigwe, ila Yesu nakoya, nakema hali hewo, nakalonga, “Mikale goya!” <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Hamba nakamlonjela Tomasi, “Uwiche chidole cha hegwe ahano, ulole moko gangu, uwiche moko wa hegwe kuli lubavu lwa heni. Uleche kuwa lunhwinhwi, ila ukunde!” <verse eid="JHN 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Tomasi nakamwidichila, “Mkulu wa heni na Nguluwi wa heni!” <verse eid="JHN 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Yesu nakamlonjela, “Ndaze, kwangukunda kwa vila nakumbona? Nawatambichizwa wala wawele hawawene, ila nawakunda.”<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chilinguganigwa kuli chitabu chino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Yesu nakadita ulajilo winji hali walanguswa wa heye uwele hawandichigwe kuli chitabu chino. <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Ila awu nawandichigwa leka kuwadita mkunde kota Yesu ndo Kilistu, Mwana wa Nguluwi na kukunda muwe na ukomu kwa ludali lwa itagwa lyake.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguwalawila walanguswa saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Logakolile ago, Yesu nakawalawila kahi walanguswa wa heye saba hafungo ha ilamba lya Tibeliya. Nakelajila kota hino, <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Simoni Petili na Tomasi yachemigwe mnyambili na Natanaeli mwenyeng'haye wa Kana kuli mkowa wa Galilaya na wana weli wa Sebedayo na walanguswa wanji weli, nawali weng'ha hamwe. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Simoni Petili nakawalonjela wayage, “Ndanguluta kulowa somba.” Nawo nawamlonjela, “Toluta hamwe.” Ahyo nawaluta, nawakwina kuli itumbwi, ila nechilo ayo hawapatile somba. <verse eid="JHN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Lokwaluche kubwemwenzuka, nawamona Yesu nakema hafungo ha ilamba, ila walanguswa hawavizelele kota nayali ndo heye. <verse eid="JHN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Lelo, Yesu nakawauza, “Wasongolo, hampatile somba?” Nawo nawamwidichila, “Hatupatile.” <verse eid="JHN 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Yesu nakawalonjela, “Mtoze utandawala kuli ubanzi wa kudilo mwa itumbwi namwe molowa somba.” Lelo, nawatoza utandawala na kulowa somba nyinji lukami mbaka nawalemwela kukwega utandawala kwa chiwalo cha winji wa somba. <verse eid="JHN 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Aho yula mlanguswa yaganigwe na Yesu nakamlonjela Simoni Petili, “Ayu ndo Mkulu.” Petili vyoyahuliche kota ndo Mkulu, nakavala ivalo lyake kwa vila nayali mwanzi na kitoza kuli mazi. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Ila wala walanguswa wanji nawoya mhwani kwa itumbwi kuno wokwega utandawala umemile somba, kwa vila hawawele kutali na isi ng'havu, ila nawali utali wa mita miya imwe kulawa hafungo. <verse eid="JHN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Lowafichile hafungo nawachona chiluli cha makala na mchanya mwa chiluli acho nahawichigwa somba na mibumunda. <verse eid="JHN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Yesu nakawalonjela, “Migale hano somba zimwe zomlowile.” <verse eid="JHN 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Lelo, Simoni Petili nakakwina kuli itumbwi, nakakwega utandawala umemile somba mbaka hafungo, nakwali na somba ng'hulu zifichile miya imwe na makumi gahano na zidatu. Hanga nazali somba nyinji ahyo, utandawala haudejeche. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Yesu nakawalonjela, “Muye mulye.” Haduhu ne yumwe wa hewo yajezile kumuuza, “Kwa whaani?” Kwa vila nawavizela kota nayali Mkulu. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Yesu nakoya, nakalihola ibumunda, nakawapa, nakadita hiho kwa zila somba.<verse eid="JHN 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Ayi nayali lwa kadatu Yesu kuwalawila walanguswa wa heye, kulawa loyazilipuche kulawa kwa wabagame.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Petili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Lowasindile kulya, Yesu nakamuuza Simoni Petili, “Simoni mwana wa Yohani, ndaze, kwangungana ng'hatu kusinda awa?” Petili nakedichila, “Ena Mkulu, hegwe kwanguvizela kota ndangukugana.” Yesu nakamlonjela, “Ujilolele miyana ing'holo ja heni.” <verse eid="JHN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Hamba nakamuuza kahi, “Simoni mwana Yohani, ndaze, kwangungana?” Petili nakedichila, “Ena Mkulu, hegwe kwanguvizela kota ndangukugana.” Yesu nakamlonjela, “Ulolele ming'holo ja heni.” <verse eid="JHN 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Nakamuuza lwa kadatu, “Simoni mwana Yohani, ndaze kwangungana?” Aho Petili nakesinza kwa vila Yesu nayali yamuuzile lwa kadatu, “Kwangungana?” Nakamlonjela, “Mkulu, hegwe kwangugazela geng'ha, kwanguvizela kota ndangukugana.” Yesu nakamlonjela, “Ujilolele ming'holo ja heni! <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Ndikomya ndangukulonjela, louwele msongolo nakuvala vyouganile na kuluta kouganile. Ila louwa sekulu, kogolola moko gako na munhu yunji kokuvaliza na kukuhilika honhu hawele hauganile kuluta.” <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />Kwa kulonga ahyo, Yesu nakalajila ndaze kubagama kwa Petili na kumtogola Nguluwi. Hamba nakamlonjela Petili, “Umbinze.”<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na yula mlanguswa yunji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Petili nakagalamka, nakamona yula mlanguswa yawele Yesu nakamgana, yowawinza. Mlanguswa ayo ndo yula yawele nakekalisa habehi ng'hatu na Yesu mhela wa chilyo cha nechilo na kumuuza, “Mkulu, whaani yokuhinduka?” <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Lelo, Petili loyamuwene ayo, nakamuuza Yesu, “Mkulu, ayu naye ndaze?” <verse eid="JHN 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Yesu nakamwidichila, “Wone ndangugana yekale mbaka hondikuya, hegwe yangukulapa choni? Hegwe umbinze!” <verse eid="JHN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Lelo, mbuli ayo nayenela hali wala walanguswa kota mlanguswa ayo hobagama. Ila Yesu nahamlonjele kota mlanguswa ayo hobagama, ila nakalonga, “Wone ndangugana yekale mbaka hondikuya, hegwe yangukulapa choni?”<verse eid="JHN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Ayo ndo yula mlanguswa yalonjile mbuli azi na kuzandika. Natwe twanguvizela kota goyalonjile ndo kukomya.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuduma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Hana mbuli zinji nyinji zoyaditile Yesu, ziwele wone nazandichigwe zeng'ha, ndangijesa kota isi yeng'ha nahayenele kuviwika vitabu viwele navyandichigwa.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>